INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (1,0,'Bulbasaur',1,45,49,49,45,65,65,'Bulbasaur can be seen napping in bright sunlight. There is a seed on its back. By soaking up the sun''s rays, the seed grows progressively larger.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (2,0,'Ivysaur',1,60,62,63,60,80,80,'To support its bulb, Ivysaur''s legs grow sturdy. If it spends more time lying in the sunlight, the bud will soon bloom into a large flower.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (3,0,'Venusaur',1,80,82,83,80,100,100,'Venusaur''s flower is said to take on vivid colors if it gets plenty of nutrition and sunlight. The flower''s aroma soothes the emotions of people.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (3,1,'Mega Venusaur',6,80,100,123,80,122,120,'In order to support its flower, which has grown larger due to Mega Evolution, its back and legs have become stronger.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (4,0,'Charmander',1,39,52,43,65,60,50,'The flame that burns at the tip of its tail is an indication of its emotions. The flame wavers when Charmander is happy, and blazes when it is enraged.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (5,0,'Charmeleon',1,58,64,58,80,80,65,'Without pity, its sharp claws destroy foes. If it encounters a strong enemy, it becomes agitated, and the flame on its tail flares with a bluish white color.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (6,0,'Charizard',1,78,84,78,100,109,85,'A Charizard flies about in search of strong opponents. It breathes intense flames that can melt any material. However, it will never torch a weaker foe.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (6,1,'Mega Charizard X',6,78,130,111,100,130,85,'The overwhelming power that fills its entire body causes it to turn black and create intense blue flames.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (6,2,'Mega Charizard Y',6,78,104,78,100,159,115,'Its bond with its Trainer is the source of its power. It boasts speed and maneuverability greater than that of a jet fighter.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (7,0,'Squirtle',1,44,48,65,43,50,64,'Its shell is not just for protection. Its rounded shape and the grooves on its surface minimize resistance in water, enabling Squirtle to swim at high speeds.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (8,0,'Wartortle',1,59,63,80,58,65,80,'Its large tail is covered with rich, thick fur that deepens in color with age. The scratches on its shell are evidence of this Pokemon''s toughness in battle.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (9,0,'Blastoise',1,79,83,100,78,85,105,'The waterspouts that protrude from its shell are highly accurate. Their bullets of water can precisely nail tin cans from a distance of over 160 feet.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (9,1,'Mega Blastoise',6,79,103,120,78,135,115,'The cannon on its back is as powerful as a tank gun. Its tough legs and back enable it to withstand the recoil from firing the cannon.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (10,0,'Caterpie',1,45,30,35,45,20,20,'Its voracious appetite compels it to devour leaves bigger than itself without hesitation. It releases a terribly strong odor from its antennae.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (11,0,'Metapod',1,50,20,55,30,25,25,'Its shell is as hard as an iron slab. A Metapod does not move very much because it is preparing its soft innards for evolution inside the shell.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (12,0,'Butterfree',1,60,45,50,70,90,80,'It has a superior ability to search for delicious honey from flowers. It can seek, extract, and carry honey from flowers blooming over six miles away.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (13,0,'Weedle',1,40,35,30,50,20,20,'A Weedle has an extremely acute sense of smell. It distinguishes its favorite kinds of leaves from those it dislikes by sniffing with its big red proboscis (nose).');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (14,0,'Kakuna',1,45,25,50,35,25,25,'It remains virtually immobile while it clings to a tree. However, on the inside, it busily prepares for evolution. This is evident from how hot its shell becomes.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (15,0,'Beedrill',1,65,90,40,75,45,80,'A Beedrill is extremely territorial. For safety reasons, no one should ever approach its nest. If angered, they will attack in a swarm.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (15,1,'Mega Beedrill',6,65,150,40,145,15,80,'Its legs have become poison stingers. It stabs its prey repeatedly with the stingers on its limbs, dealing the final blow with the stinger on its rear.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (16,0,'Pidgey',1,40,45,40,56,35,35,'It has an extremely sharp sense of direction. It can unerringly return home to its nest, however far it may be removed from its familiar surroundings.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (17,0,'Pidgeotto',1,63,60,55,71,50,50,'This Pokemon flies around, patrolling its large territory. If its living space is violated, it shows no mercy in thoroughly punishing the foe with its sharp claws.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (18,0,'Pidgeot',1,83,80,75,101,70,70,'Pidgeot has gorgeous, glossy feathers. Many trainers are so captivated by the beautiful feathers on its head that they choose Pidgeot as their Pokemon.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (18,1,'Mega Pidgeot',6,83,80,80,121,135,80,'With its muscular strength now greatly increased, it can fly continuously for two weeks without resting.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (19,0,'Rattata',1,30,56,35,72,25,35,'A Rattata is cautious in the extreme. Even while it is asleep, it constantly moves its ears and listens for danger. It will make its nest anywhere.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (19,1,'Alolan Rattata',7,30,56,35,72,25,35,'With its incisors, it gnaws through doors and infiltrates people''s homes. Then, with a twitch of its whiskers, it steals whatever food it finds.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (20,0,'Raticate',1,55,81,60,97,50,70,'A Raticate''s sturdy fangs grow steadily. To keep them ground down, it gnaws on rocks and logs. It may even chew on the walls of houses.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (20,1,'Alolan Raticate',7,75,71,70,77,40,80,'It forms a group of Rattata, which it assumes command of. Each group has its own territory, and disputes over food happen often.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (21,0,'Spearow',1,40,60,30,70,31,31,'Its loud cry can be heard over half a mile away. If its high, keening cry is heard echoing all around, it is a sign that they are warning each other of danger.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (22,0,'Fearow',1,65,90,65,100,61,61,'Its long neck and elongated beak are ideal for catching prey in soil or water. It deftly moves this extended and skinny beak to pluck prey.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (23,0,'Ekans',1,35,60,44,55,40,54,'An Ekans curls itself up in a spiral while it rests. This position allows it to quickly respond to an enemy from any direction with a threat from its upraised head.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (24,0,'Arbok',1,60,95,69,80,65,79,'This Pokemon has a terrifically strong constricting power. It can even flatten steel oil drums. Once it wraps its body around its foe, escaping is impossible.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (25,0,'Pikachu',1,35,55,40,90,50,50,'It stores electricity in the electric sacs on its cheeks. When it releases pent-up energy in a burst, the electric power is equal to a lightning bolt.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (26,0,'Raichu',1,60,90,55,110,90,80,'If it stores too much electricity, its behavior turns aggressive. To avoid this, it occasionally discharges excess energy and calms itself down.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (26,1,'Alolan Raichu',7,60,85,50,110,95,85,'It uses psychokinesis to control electricity. It hops aboard its own tail, using psychic power to lift the tail and move about while riding it.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (27,0,'Sandshrew',1,50,75,85,40,20,30,'When it curls up in a ball, it can make any attack bounce off harmlessly. Its hide has turned tough and solid as a result of living in the desert.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (27,1,'Alolan Sandshrew',7,50,75,90,40,10,35,'The skin on its back is as hard as steel. Predators go after its soft belly, so it clings to the ground desperately.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (28,0,'Sandslash',1,75,100,110,65,45,55,'It curls up in a ball to protect itself from enemy attacks. It also curls up to prevent heatstroke during the daytime when temperatures rise sharply.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (28,1,'Alolan Sandslash',7,75,100,120,65,25,65,'It runs across snow-covered plains at high speeds. It developed thick, sharp claws to plow through the snow.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (29,0,'Nidoran♀',1,55,47,52,41,40,40,'Its highly toxic barbs are thought to have developed as protection for this small-bodied Pokemon. When enraged, it releases a horrible toxin from its horn.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (30,0,'Nidorina',1,70,62,67,56,55,55,'When it is with its friends or family, its barbs are tucked away to prevent injury. It appears to become nervous if separated from the others.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (31,0,'Nidoqueen',1,90,92,87,76,75,85,'It is adept at sending foes flying with harsh tackles using its tough, scaly body. This Pokemon is at its strongest when it is defending its young.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (32,0,'Nidoran♂',1,46,57,40,50,40,40,'The male Nidoran has developed muscles that freely move its ears in any direction. Even the slightest sound does not escape this Pokemon''s notice.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (33,0,'Nidorino',1,61,72,57,65,55,55,'Its horn is harder than a diamond. If it senses a hostile presence, all the barbs on its back bristle up at once, and it challenges the foe with all its might.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (34,0,'Nidoking',1,81,102,77,85,85,75,'A Nidoking''s thick tail packs enormously destructive power capable of toppling a metal transmission tower. Once it goes on a rampage, there is no stopping it.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (35,0,'Clefairy',1,70,45,48,35,60,65,'On every night of a full moon, they come out to play. When dawn arrives, the tired Clefairy go to sleep nestled up against each other in deep and quiet mountains.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (36,0,'Clefable',1,95,70,73,60,95,90,'A Clefable uses its wings to skip lightly as if it were flying. Its bouncy step lets it even walk on water. On quiet, moonlit nights, it strolls on lakes.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (37,0,'Vulpix',1,38,41,40,65,50,65,'It can freely control fire, making fiery orbs fly like will-o''-the-wisps. Just before evolution, its six tails grow hot as if on fire.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (37,1,'Alolan Vulpix',7,38,41,40,65,50,65,'In hot weather, this Pokemon makes ice shards with its six tails and sprays them around to cool itself off.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (38,0,'Ninetales',1,73,76,75,100,81,100,'It has long been said that each of the nine tails embody an enchanted power. A long-lived Ninetales will have fur that shines like gold.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (38,1,'Alolan Ninetales',7,73,67,75,109,81,100,'It lives on mountains perpetually covered in snow and is revered as a deity incarnate. It appears draped in a blizzard.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (39,0,'Jigglypuff',1,115,45,20,20,45,25,'Nothing can avoid falling asleep hearing a Jigglypuff''s song. The sound waves of its singing voice match the brain waves of someone in a deep sleep.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (40,0,'Wigglytuff',1,140,70,45,45,85,50,'Its fur is the ultimate in luxuriousness. Sleeping alongside a Wigglytuff is simply divine. Its body expands seemingly without end when it inhales.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (41,0,'Zubat',1,40,45,35,55,30,40,'While living in pitch-black caverns, their eyes gradually grew shut and deprived them of vision. They use ultrasonic waves to detect obstacles.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (42,0,'Golbat',1,75,80,70,90,65,75,'Its fangs easily puncture even thick animal hide. It loves to feast on the blood of people and Pokemon. It flits about in darkness and strikes from behind.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (43,0,'Oddish',1,45,50,55,30,75,65,'It grows by absorbing moonlight. During the daytime, it buries itself in the ground, leaving only its leaves exposed to avoid detection by its enemies.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (44,0,'Gloom',1,60,65,70,40,85,75,'A horribly noxious honey drools from its mouth. One whiff of the honey can result in memory loss. Some fans are said to enjoy this overwhelming stink, however.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (45,0,'Vileplume',1,75,80,85,50,110,90,'In seasons when it produces more pollen, the air around a Vileplume turns yellow with the powder as it walks. The pollen is highly toxic and causes paralysis.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (46,0,'Paras',1,35,70,55,25,45,55,'A Paras has parasitic tochukaso mushrooms growing on its back. They grow by drawing nutrients from the host. They are valued as a medicine for long life.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (47,0,'Parasect',1,60,95,80,30,60,80,'Parasect are known to infest the roots of large trees en masse and drain nutrients. When an infested tree dies, they move onto another tree all at once.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (48,0,'Venonat',1,60,55,50,45,40,55,'Its coat of thin, stiff hair that covers its entire body is said to have evolved for protection. Its large eyes never fail to spot even miniscule prey.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (49,0,'Venomoth',1,70,65,60,90,90,75,'Venomoth are nocturnal--they only are active at night. Their favorite prey are insects that gather around streetlights, attracted by the light in the darkness.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (50,0,'Diglett',1,10,55,25,95,35,45,'Diglett are raised in most farms. The reason is simple--wherever they burrow, the soil is left perfectly tilled for growing delicious crops.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (50,1,'Alolan Diglett',7,10,55,30,90,35,45,'Its head sports an altered form of whiskers made of metal. When in communication with its comrades, its whiskers wobble to and fro.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (51,0,'Dugtrio',1,35,100,50,120,50,70,'Because the triplets originally split from one body, they think exactly alike. They work cooperatively to burrow endlessly through the ground.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (51,1,'Alolan Dugtrio',7,35,100,60,110,50,70,'Its shining gold hair provides it with protection. It''s reputed that keeping any of its fallen hairs will bring bad luck.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (52,0,'Meowth',1,40,45,35,90,40,40,'Meowth withdraw their sharp claws into their paws to silently sneak about. For some reason, this Pokemon loves shiny coins that glitter with light.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (52,1,'Alolan Meowth',7,40,35,35,90,50,40,'It''s impulsive, selfish, and fickle. It''s very popular with some Trainers who like giving it the attention it needs.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (52,2,'Galarian Meowth',8,50,65,55,40,40,40,'Living with a savage, seafaring people has toughened this Pokemon''s body so much that parts of it have turned to iron.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (53,0,'Persian',1,65,70,60,115,65,65,'A Persian''s six bold whiskers sense air movements to determine what is in its vicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed by the whiskers.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (53,1,'Alolan Persian',7,65,60,60,115,75,65,'Its round face is a symbol of wealth. Persian that have bigger, plumper faces are considered more beautiful.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (54,0,'Psyduck',1,50,52,48,55,65,50,'When its headache intensifies, it starts using strange powers. However, it has no recollection of its powers, so it always looks befuddled and bewildered.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (55,0,'Golduck',1,80,82,78,85,95,80,'A Golduck is an adept swimmer. It sometimes joins competitive swimmers in training. It uses psychic powers when its forehead shimmers with light.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (56,0,'Mankey',1,40,80,35,70,35,45,'When it starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it''s a sure sign of anger. However, since this happens instantly, there is no time to flee.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (57,0,'Primeape',1,65,105,60,95,60,70,'When it becomes furious, its blood circulation becomes more robust, and its muscles are made stronger. But it also becomes much less intelligent.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (58,0,'Growlithe',1,55,70,45,60,70,50,'Its superb sense of smell ensures that this Pokemon won''t forget any scent, no matter what. It uses its sense of smell to detect the emotions of others.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (59,0,'Arcanine',1,90,110,80,95,100,80,'This fleet-footed Pokemon is said to run over 6,200 miles in a single day and night. The fire that blazes wildly within its body is its source of power.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (60,0,'Poliwag',1,40,50,40,90,40,40,'It is possible to see this Pokemon''s spiral innards right through its thin skin. However, the skin is also very flexible. Even sharp fangs bounce right off it.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (61,0,'Poliwhirl',1,65,65,65,90,50,50,'Its body surface is always wet and slick with an oily fluid. Because of this greasy covering, it can easily slip and slide out of the clutches of any enemy in battle.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (62,0,'Poliwrath',1,90,95,95,70,70,90,'Its highly developed muscles never grow fatigued, however much it exercises. This Pokemon can swim back and forth across the Pacific Ocean without effort.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (63,0,'Abra',1,25,20,15,90,105,55,'A Pokemon that sleeps 18 hours a day. Observation revealed that it uses Teleport to change its location once every hour.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (64,0,'Kadabra',1,40,35,30,105,120,70,'It is rumored that a boy with psychic abilities suddenly transformed into Kadabra while he was assisting research into extrasensory powers.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (65,0,'Alakazam',1,55,50,45,120,135,95,'While it has strong psychic abilities and high intelligence, an Alakazam''s muscles are very weak. It uses psychic power to move its body.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (65,1,'Mega Alakazam',6,55,50,65,150,175,105,'Having traded away its muscles, Alakazam''s true power has been unleashed. With its psychic powers, it can foresee all things.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (66,0,'Machop',1,70,80,50,35,35,35,'It continually undertakes strenuous training to master all forms of martial arts. Its strength lets it easily hoist a sumo wrestler onto its shoulders.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (67,0,'Machoke',1,80,100,70,45,50,60,'A belt is worn by a Machoke to keep its overwhelming power under control. Because it is so dangerous, no one has ever removed the belt.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (68,0,'Machamp',1,90,130,80,55,65,85,'It is impossible to defend against punches and chops doled out by its four arms. Its fighting spirit flares up when it faces a tough opponent.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (69,0,'Bellsprout',1,50,75,35,40,70,30,'A Bellsprout''s thin and flexible body lets it bend and sway to avoid any attack, however strong it may be. From its mouth, it leaks a fluid that melts even iron.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (70,0,'Weepinbell',1,65,90,50,55,85,45,'At night, a Weepinbell hangs on to a tree branch with its hooked rear and sleeps. If it moves around in its sleep, it may wake up to find itself on the ground.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (71,0,'Victreebel',1,80,105,65,70,100,70,'The long vine extending from its head is waved about as if it were a living thing to attract prey. When an unsuspecting victim approaches, it is swallowed whole.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (72,0,'Tentacool',1,40,40,35,70,50,100,'Its body is almost entirely composed of water. It ensnares its foe with its two long tentacles, then stabs with the poison stingers at their tips.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (73,0,'Tentacruel',1,80,70,65,100,80,120,'It lives in complex rock formations on the ocean floor and traps prey using its 80 tentacles. Its red orbs glow when it grows excited or agitated.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (74,0,'Geodude',1,40,80,100,20,30,30,'It climbs mountain paths using only the power of its arms. Because they look just like boulders lining paths, hikers may step on them without noticing.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (74,1,'Alolan Geodude',7,40,80,100,20,30,30,'Geodude compete against each other with headbutts. The iron sand on their heads will stick to whichever one has stronger magnetism.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (75,0,'Graveler',1,55,95,115,35,45,45,'They descend from mountains by tumbling down steep slopes. They are so brutal, they smash aside obstructing trees and huge boulders with thunderous tackles.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (75,1,'Alolan Graveler',7,55,95,115,35,45,45,'They eat rocks and often get into a scrap over them. The shock of Graveler smashing together causes a flash of light and a booming noise.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (76,0,'Golem',1,80,120,130,45,55,65,'It is said to live in volcanic craters on mountain peaks. Once a year, it sheds its hide and grows larger. The shed hide crumbles and returns to the soil.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (76,1,'Alolan Golem',7,80,120,130,45,55,65,'It fires rocks charged with electricity. Even if the rock isn''t fired that accurately, just grazing an opponent will cause numbness and fainting.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (77,0,'Ponyta',1,50,85,55,90,65,65,'A Ponyta is very weak at birth. It can barely stand up. Its legs become stronger as it stumbles and falls while trying to keep up with its parent.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (77,1,'Galarian Ponyta',8,50,85,55,90,65,65,'Its small horn hides a healing power. With a few rubs from this Pokemon''s horn, any slight wound you have will be healed.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (78,0,'Rapidash',1,65,100,70,105,80,80,'It usually canters casually in the fields and plains. But once a Rapidash turns serious, its fiery manes flare and blaze as it gallops its way up to 150 mph.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (78,1,'Galarian Rapidash',8,65,100,70,105,80,80,'Little can stand up to its psycho cut. Unleashed from this Pokemon''s horn, the move will punch a hole right through a thick metal sheet.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (79,0,'Slowpoke',1,90,65,65,15,40,40,'It catches prey by dipping its tail in water at the side of a river. But it often forgets what it is doing and spends whole days just loafing at the water''s edge.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (79,1,'Galarian Slowpoke',8,90,65,65,15,40,40,'Although this Pokemon is normally zoned out, its expression abruptly sharpens on occasion. The cause for this seems to lie in Slowpoke''s diet.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (80,0,'Slowbro',1,95,75,110,30,100,80,'Its tail has a Shellder firmly attached with a bite. As a result, the tail can''t be used for fishing anymore. This forces it to reluctantly swim and catch prey.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (80,1,'Galarian Slowbro',8,95,100,95,30,100,70,'If this Pokemon squeezes the tongue of the Shellder biting it, the Shellder will launch a toxic liquid from the tip of its shell.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (80,2,'Mega Slowbro',6,95,75,180,30,130,80,'Having been swallowed whole by Shellder, Slowbro now has an iron defense. It''s pretty comfortable in there, too.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (81,0,'Magnemite',1,25,35,70,45,95,55,'The units at its sides are extremely powerful magnets. They generate enough magnetism to draw in iron objects from over 300 feet away.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (82,0,'Magneton',1,50,60,95,70,120,70,'It is actually three Magnemite linked by magnetism. It generates powerful radio waves that raise temperatures by 3.6 degrees F within a 3,300-foot radius.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (83,0,'Farfetch''d',1,52,90,55,60,58,62,'It is always seen with a stick from a plant. Apparently, there are good sticks and bad sticks. This Pokemon occasionally fights with others over choice sticks.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (83,1,'Galarian Farfetch''d',8,52,95,55,55,58,62,'The stalks of leeks are thicker and longer in the Galar region. Farfetch''d that adapted to these stalks took on a unique form.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (84,0,'Doduo',1,35,85,45,75,35,35,'Even while eating or sleeping, one of the heads remains always vigilant for any sign of danger. When threatened, it flees at over 60 miles per hour.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (85,0,'Dodrio',1,60,110,70,110,60,60,'A peculiar Pokemon species with three heads. It vigorously races across grassy plains even in arid seasons with little rainfall.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (86,0,'Seel',1,65,45,55,45,45,70,'Seel hunt for prey in frigid, ice-covered seas. When it needs to breathe, it punches a hole through the ice with the sharply protruding section of its head.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (87,0,'Dewgong',1,90,70,80,70,70,95,'It loves to snooze on bitterly cold ice. The sight of this Pokemon sleeping on a glacier was mistakenly thought to be a mermaid by a mariner long ago.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (88,0,'Grimer',1,80,80,50,25,40,50,'Born from polluted sludge in the sea, Grimer''s favorite food is anything filthy. They feed on wastewater pumped out from factories.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (88,1,'Alolan Grimer',7,80,80,50,25,40,50,'A Grimer, which had been brought in to solve a problem with garbage, developed over time into this form.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (89,0,'Muk',1,105,105,75,50,65,100,'It prefers warm and humid habitats. In the summertime, the toxic substances in its body intensify, making Muk reek like putrid kitchen garbage.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (89,1,'Alolan Muk',7,105,105,75,50,65,100,'The garbage it eats causes continuous chemical changes in its body, which produce its exceedingly vivid coloration.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (90,0,'Shellder',1,30,65,100,40,45,25,'At night, it burrows a hole in the seafloor with its broad tongue to make a place to sleep. While asleep, it closes its shell, but leaves its tongue hanging out.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (91,0,'Cloyster',1,50,95,180,70,85,45,'It swims in the sea by swallowing water, then jetting it out toward the rear. The Cloyster shoots spikes from its shell using the same system.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (92,0,'Gastly',1,30,35,30,80,100,35,'When exposed to a strong wind, a Gastly''s gaseous body quickly dwindles away. They cluster under the eaves of houses to escape the ravages of wind.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (93,0,'Haunter',1,45,50,45,95,115,55,'If a Haunter beckons you while it is floating in darkness, don''t approach it. This Pokemon will try to lick you with its tongue and steal your life away.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (94,0,'Gengar',1,60,65,60,110,130,75,'Deep in the night, your shadow cast by a streetlight may suddenly overtake you. It is actually a Gengar running past you, pretending to be your shadow.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (94,1,'Mega Gengar',6,60,65,80,130,170,95,'The energy of Mega Evolution awakened it. It sinks into another dimension, where it keeps a patient watch for its chance to attack.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (95,0,'Onix',1,35,45,160,70,30,45,'There is a magnet in its brain that prevents an Onix from losing direction while tunneling. As it grows older, its body becomes steadily rounder and smoother.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (96,0,'Drowzee',1,60,48,45,42,43,90,'If your nose becomes itchy while you are sleeping, it''s a sure sign that a Drowzee is standing above your pillow and trying to eat your dream through your nostrils.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (97,0,'Hypno',1,85,73,70,67,73,115,'The arcing movement and glitter of the pendulum in a Hypno''s hand lull the foe into deep hypnosis. While searching for prey, it polishes the pendulum.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (98,0,'Krabby',1,30,105,90,50,25,25,'Krabby live in holes dug into beaches. On sandy shores with little in the way of food, they can be seen squabbling with each other over territory.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (99,0,'Kingler',1,55,130,115,75,50,50,'It waves its huge, oversized claw in the air to communicate with others. But since the claw is so heavy, this Pokemon quickly tires.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (100,0,'Voltorb',1,40,30,50,100,55,55,'It bears an uncanny and unexplained resemblance to a Poke Ball. Because it explodes at the slightest shock, even veteran trainers treat it with caution.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (101,0,'Electrode',1,60,50,70,150,80,80,'They appear in great numbers at electric power plants. Because they feed on electricity, they cause massive and chaotic blackouts in nearby cities.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (102,0,'Exeggcute',1,60,40,80,40,60,45,'It consists of six eggs that care for each other. The eggs attract each other and spin around. When cracks increasingly appear, it is close to evolution.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (103,0,'Exeggutor',1,95,95,85,55,125,75,'Originally from the tropics, Exeggutor''s heads grow larger with exposure to bright sunlight. It is said that when the heads fall, they group to form an Exeggcute.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (103,1,'Alolan Exeggutor',7,95,105,85,45,125,75,'As it grew taller and taller, it outgrew its reliance on psychic powers, while within it awakened the power of the sleeping dragon.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (104,0,'Cubone',1,50,50,95,35,40,50,'It pines for the mother it will never see again. Seeing a likeness of its mother in the full moon, it cries. The stains on the skull it wears are from its tears.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (105,0,'Marowak',1,60,80,110,45,50,80,'A Marowak is the evolved form of a Cubone that has grown tough by overcoming the grief of losing its mother. Its tempered and hardened spirit is not easily broken.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (105,1,'Alolan Marowak',7,60,80,110,45,50,80,'Its custom is to mourn its lost companions. Mounds of dirt by the side of the road mark the graves of the Marowak.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (106,0,'Hitmonlee',1,50,120,53,87,35,110,'Its legs freely stretch and contract. Using these springlike limbs, it bowls over foes with devastating kicks. After battle, it rubs down its tired legs.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (107,0,'Hitmonchan',1,50,105,79,76,35,110,'A Hitmonchan is said to possess the spirit of a boxer who aimed to become the world champion. Having an indomitable spirit means that it will never give up.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (108,0,'Lickitung',1,90,55,75,30,60,75,'Whenever it sees something unfamiliar, it always licks the object because it memorizes things by texture and taste. It is somewhat put off by sour things.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (109,0,'Koffing',1,40,65,95,35,60,45,'Getting up close to a Koffing will give you a chance to observe, through its thin skin, the toxic gases swirling inside. It blows up at the slightest stimulation.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (110,0,'Weezing',1,65,90,120,60,85,70,'By diluting its toxic gases with a special process, the highest grade of perfume can be made. To Weezing, gases emanating from garbage are the ultimate feast.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (110,1,'Galarian Weezing',8,65,90,120,60,85,70,'This Pokemon consumes particles that contaminate the air. Instead of leaving droppings, it expels clean air.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (111,0,'Rhyhorn',1,80,85,95,25,30,30,'Once it starts running, it doesn''t stop. Its tiny brain makes it so stupid that it can''t remember why it started running in the first place.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (112,0,'Rhydon',1,105,130,120,40,45,45,'Its horn, which rotates like a drill, destroys tall buildings with one strike. It stands on its hind legs, and its brain is well developed.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (113,0,'Chansey',1,250,5,5,50,35,105,'Chansey lay nutritionally excellent eggs every day. The eggs are so delicious, they are eagerly devoured by even those who have lost their appetite.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (114,0,'Tangela',1,65,55,115,60,100,40,'Its vines snap off easily and painlessly if they are grabbed, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by new growth the very next day.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (115,0,'Kangaskhan',1,105,95,80,90,40,80,'If you come across a young Kangaskhan playing by itself, never try to catch it. The baby''s parent is sure to be in the area, and it will become violently enraged.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (115,1,'Mega Kangaskhan',6,105,125,100,100,60,100,'The explosive energy the child is bathed in causes temporary growth. The mother is beside herself with worry about it.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (116,0,'Horsea',1,30,40,70,60,70,25,'By cleverly flicking the fins on its back side to side, it moves in any direction while facing forward. It spits ink to escape if it senses danger.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (117,0,'Seadra',1,55,65,95,85,95,45,'The poisonous barbs all over its body are highly valued as ingredients for making traditional herbal medicine. It shows no mercy to anything approaching its nest.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (118,0,'Goldeen',1,45,67,60,63,35,50,'In the springtime, schools of Goldeen can be seen swimming up falls and rivers. It metes out staggering damage with its single horn.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (119,0,'Seaking',1,80,92,65,68,65,80,'It punches holes in boulders on stream- beds. This is a clever innovation that prevents its eggs from being attacked or washed away by the current.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (120,0,'Staryu',1,30,45,55,85,70,55,'It gathers with others in the night and makes its red core glow on and off with the twinkling stars. It can regenerate limbs if they are severed from its body.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (121,0,'Starmie',1,60,75,85,115,100,85,'People in ancient times imagined that Starmie were transformed from the reflections of stars that twinkled on gentle waves at night.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (122,0,'Mr. Mime',1,40,45,65,90,100,120,'A Mr. Mime is a master of pantomime. It can convince others that something unseeable actually exists. Once believed, the imaginary object does become real.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (122,1,'Galarian Mr. Mime',8,50,65,65,100,90,90,'Its talent is tap-dancing. It can also manipulate temperatures to create a floor of ice, which this Pokemon can kick up to use as a barrier.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (123,0,'Scyther',1,70,110,80,105,55,80,'Its blindingly fast speed adds to the sharpness of its twin forearm scythes. The scythes can slice through thick logs in one wicked stroke.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (124,0,'Jynx',1,65,50,35,95,115,95,'A Jynx sashays rhythmically as if it were dancing. Its motions are so bouncingly alluring, people seeing it are compelled to shake their hips without noticing.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (125,0,'Electabuzz',1,65,83,57,105,95,85,'When a storm approaches, it competes with others to scale heights that are likely to be stricken by lightning. Some towns use Electabuzz as lightning rods.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (126,0,'Magmar',1,65,95,57,93,100,85,'In battle, it blows out intense flames from all over its body to intimidate its foe. These fiery bursts create heat waves that ignite grass and trees.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (127,0,'Pinsir',1,65,125,100,85,55,70,'Their pincers are strong enough to shatter thick logs. Because they dislike cold, Pinsir burrow and sleep under the ground on chilly nights.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (127,1,'Mega Pinsir',6,65,155,120,105,65,90,'It zips around at blistering speeds, looking for an opening to skewer its opponent on its giant pincers.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (128,0,'Tauros',1,75,100,95,110,40,70,'It is not satisfied unless it is rampaging at all times. If there is no opponent for Tauros to battle, it will charge at thick trees and knock them down to calm itself.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (129,0,'Magikarp',1,20,10,55,80,15,20,'Its swimming muscles are weak, so it is easily washed away by currents. In places where water pools, you can see many Magikarp deposited there by the flow.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (130,0,'Gyarados',1,95,125,79,81,60,100,'It is an extremely vicious and violent Pokemon. When humans begin to fight, it will appear and burn everything to the ground with intensely hot flames.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (130,1,'Mega Gyarados',6,95,155,109,81,70,130,'It zooms out of the water at Mach speeds. Even large ships caught in its path are split cleanly in two!');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (131,0,'Lapras',1,130,85,80,60,85,95,'People have driven Lapras almost to the point of extinction. In the evenings, it is said to sing plaintively as it seeks what few others of its kind still remain.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (132,0,'Ditto',1,48,48,48,48,48,48,'A Ditto rearranges its cell structure to transform itself. However, if it tries to change based on its memory, it will get details wrong.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (133,0,'Eevee',1,55,55,50,55,45,65,'An Eevee has an unstable genetic makeup that suddenly mutates due to its environment. Radiation from various stones causes this Pokemon to evolve.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (134,0,'Vaporeon',1,130,65,60,65,110,95,'Vaporeon underwent a spontaneous mutation and grew fins and gills that allow them to live underwater. They have the ability to freely control water.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (135,0,'Jolteon',1,65,65,60,130,110,95,'Its cells generate weak power that is amplified by its fur''s static electricity to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (136,0,'Flareon',1,65,130,60,65,95,110,'Flareon''s fluffy fur releases heat into the air so that its body does not get excessively hot. Its body temperature can rise to a maximum of 1,650 degrees F.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (137,0,'Porygon',1,65,60,70,40,85,75,'It is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data in order to enter cyberspace. A Porygon is copy-protected so it cannot be duplicated.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (138,0,'Omanyte',1,35,40,100,35,90,55,'One of the ancient and long-since-extinct Pokemon that have been regenerated from fossils by humans. If attacked, it withdraws into its hard shell.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (139,0,'Omastar',1,70,60,125,55,115,70,'An Omastar uses its tentacles to capture its prey. It is believed to have become extinct because its shell grew too large, making its movements slow and ponderous.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (140,0,'Kabuto',1,30,80,90,55,55,45,'This Pokemon has been regenerated from a fossil. However, in rare cases, living examples have been discovered. Kabuto have not changed for 300 million years.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (141,0,'Kabutops',1,60,115,105,80,65,70,'Kabutops once swam underwater to hunt for prey. It was apparently evolving from being a water dweller to living on land as evident from changes in its gills and legs.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (142,0,'Aerodactyl',1,80,105,65,130,60,75,'Aerodactyl is a Pokemon from the age of dinosaurs. It was regenerated from DNA extracted from amber. It is imagined to have been the king of the skies.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (142,1,'Mega Aerodactyl',6,80,135,85,150,70,95,'When it Mega Evolves, it becomes more vicious than ever before. Some say that''s because its excess of power is causing it pain.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (143,0,'Snorlax',1,160,110,65,30,65,110,'Snorlax''s typical day consists of nothing more than eating and sleeping. It is such a docile Pokemon that there are children who use its big belly as a place to play.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (144,0,'Articuno',1,90,85,100,85,95,125,'Articuno is a legendary bird Pokemon that can control ice. The flapping of its wings chills the air. As a result, it is said that when this Pokemon flies, snow will fall.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (144,1,'Galarian Articuno',8,90,85,85,95,125,100,'Its feather-like blades are composed of psychic energy and can shear through thick iron sheets as if they were paper.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (145,0,'Zapdos',1,90,90,85,100,125,90,'Zapdos is a legendary bird Pokemon that has the ability to control electricity. It usually lives in thunderclouds. It gains power if it is stricken by lightning bolts.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (145,1,'Galarian Zapdos',8,90,125,90,100,85,90,'When its feathers rub together, they produce a crackling sound like the zapping of electricity. That''s why this Pokemon is called Zapdos.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (146,0,'Moltres',1,90,100,90,90,125,85,'Moltres is a legendary bird Pokemon that can control fire. If injured, it is said to dip its body in the molten magma of a volcano to burn and heal itself.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (146,1,'Galarian Moltres',8,90,85,90,90,100,125,'This Pokemon''s sinister, flame-like aura will consume the spirit of any creature it hits. Victims become burned-out shadows of themselves.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (147,0,'Dratini',1,41,64,45,50,50,50,'A Dratini continually molts and sloughs off its old skin. It does so because the life energy within its body steadily builds to reach uncontrollable levels.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (148,0,'Dragonair',1,61,84,65,70,70,70,'A Dragonair stores an enormous amount of energy inside its body. It is said to alter the weather around it by loosing energy from the crystals on its neck and tail.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (149,0,'Dragonite',1,91,134,95,80,100,100,'It can circle the globe in just 16 hours. It is a kindhearted Pokemon that leads lost and foundering ships in a storm to the safety of land.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (150,0,'Mewtwo',1,106,110,90,130,154,90,'A Pokemon that was created by genetic manipulation. However, even though the scientific power of humans made its body, they failed to give it a warm heart.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (150,1,'Mega Mewtwo X',6,106,190,100,130,154,100,'Psychic power has augmented its muscles. It has a grip strength of one ton and can sprint a hundred meters in two seconds flat!');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (150,2,'Mega Mewtwo Y',6,106,150,70,140,194,120,'Despite its diminished size, its mental power has grown phenomenally. With a mere thought, it can smash a skyscraper to smithereens.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (151,0,'Mew',1,100,100,100,100,100,100,'A Mew is said to possess the genes of all Pokemon. It is capable of making itself invisible at will, so it entirely avoids notice even if it approaches people.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (152,0,'Chikorita',2,45,49,65,45,49,65,'It waves its leaf around to keep foes at bay. However, a sweet fragrance also wafts from the leaf, creating a friendly atmosphere that becalms the battlers.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (153,0,'Bayleef',2,60,62,80,60,63,80,'A Bayleef''s neck is ringed by curled-up leaves. Inside each leaf is a small tree shoot. The fragrance of this shoot makes people peppy.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (154,0,'Meganium',2,80,82,100,80,83,100,'The fragrance of a Meganium''s flower soothes and calms emotions. In battle, it gives off more of its becalming scent to blunt the foe''s fighting spirit.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (155,0,'Cyndaquil',2,39,52,43,65,60,50,'It flares flames from its back to protect itself. The fire burns vigorously if the Pokemon is angry. When it is tired, it sputters with incomplete combustion.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (156,0,'Quilava',2,58,64,58,80,80,65,'It intimidates foes with intense gusts of flames and superheated air. Its quick nimbleness lets it dodge attacks even while scorching an enemy.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (157,0,'Typhlosion',2,78,84,78,100,109,85,'It can hide behind a shimmering heat haze that it creates using its intense flames. Typhlosion create blazing explosive blasts that burn everything to cinders.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (158,0,'Totodile',2,50,65,64,43,44,48,'Despite its small body, Totodile''s jaws are very powerful. While it may think it is just playfully nipping, its bite has enough strength to cause serious injury.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (159,0,'Croconaw',2,65,80,80,58,59,63,'Once its jaws clamp down on its foe, it will absolutely not let go. Because the tips of its fangs are forked back like fishhooks, they become irremovably embedded.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (160,0,'Feraligatr',2,85,105,100,78,79,83,'It opens its huge mouth to intimidate enemies. In battle, it runs using its thick and powerful hind legs to charge the foe with incredible speed.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (161,0,'Sentret',2,35,46,34,20,35,45,'They take turns standing guard when it is time to sleep. The sentry awakens the others if it senses danger. If one gets separated, it turns sleepless with fear.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (162,0,'Furret',2,85,76,64,90,45,55,'A Furret has a very slim build. When under attack, it can squirm through narrow spaces and get away. In spite of its short limbs, it is very nimble and fleet.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (163,0,'Hoothoot',2,60,30,30,50,36,56,'It has an internal organ that senses the earth''s rotation. Using this special organ, a Hoothoot begins hooting at precisely the same time every day.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (164,0,'Noctowl',2,100,50,50,70,86,96,'It unfailingly catches prey in darkness. Noctowl owe their success to superior vision that allows them to see in minimal light, and to their supple and silent wings.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (165,0,'Ledyba',2,40,20,30,55,40,80,'Ledyba communicate using a fluid that they secrete from where the legs join the body. They are said to convey feelings to others by altering the fluid''s scent.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (166,0,'Ledian',2,55,35,50,85,55,110,'It is said that in lands with clean air, where the stars fill the sky, there live many Ledian. For good reason, they use the light of the stars as energy.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (167,0,'Spinarak',2,40,60,40,30,40,40,'The web it spins can be considered its second nervous system. It is said that a Spinarak determines its prey by the tiny vibrations it feels through the web.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (168,0,'Ariados',2,70,90,70,40,60,70,'Its feet are tipped with tiny hooked claws that enable it to scuttle on ceilings and vertical walls. It constricts its foe with thin and strong silk webbing.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (169,0,'Crobat',2,85,90,80,130,70,80,'Over the course of evolution, its hind legs turned into wings. By alternately resting its front and rear wings, it can fly all day without having to stop.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (170,0,'Chinchou',2,75,38,38,67,56,56,'When it senses danger, it discharges positive and negative electricity from its two antennae. It lives in depths beyond sunlight''s reach.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (171,0,'Lanturn',2,125,58,58,67,76,76,'The light-emitting orbs on its back are very bright. They are formed from a part of its dorsal fin. This Pokemon illuminates the inky darkness of deep seas.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (172,0,'Pichu',2,20,40,15,60,35,35,'It is still inept at retaining electricity. When it is startled, it discharges power accidentally. It gets better at holding power as it grows older.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (172,2,'Spiky-Eared Pichu',4,20,40,15,60,35,35,'It is still inept at retaining electricity. When it is startled, it discharges power accidentally. It gets better at holding power as it grows older.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (173,0,'Cleffa',2,50,25,28,15,45,55,'On nights with many shooting stars, Cleffa can be seen dancing in a ring. They dance until daybreak, when they quench their thirst with the morning dew.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (174,0,'Igglybuff',2,90,30,15,15,40,20,'Its soft and pliable body is very bouncy. When it sings continuously with all its might, its body steadily turns a deepening pink color.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (175,0,'Togepi',2,35,20,65,20,40,65,'As its energy, it uses the feelings of compassion and pleasure exuded by people and Pokemon. It stores up happy feelings in its shell, then shares them out.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (176,0,'Togetic',2,55,40,85,40,80,105,'It is said to be a Pokemon that brings good fortune. When it spots someone who is pure of heart, a Togetic appears and shares its happiness with that person.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (177,0,'Natu',2,40,50,45,70,70,45,'It runs up short trees that grow on the savanna to peck at new shoots. A Natu''s eyes look as if they are always observing something.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (178,0,'Xatu',2,65,75,70,95,95,70,'It has the enigmatic power of foreseeing the future. Some people in different lands have long believed that Xatu are emissaries from another world.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (179,0,'Mareep',2,55,40,40,35,65,45,'Its fluffy wool rubs together and builds a static charge. The more energy is charged, the more brightly the lightbulb at the tip of its tail glows.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (180,0,'Flaaffy',2,70,55,55,45,80,60,'Its fleece quality changes to generate strong static electricity with a small amount of wool. The bare, slick parts of its hide are shielded against electricity.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (181,0,'Ampharos',2,90,75,85,55,115,90,'It gives off so much light that it can be seen even from space. People in the old days used its light to send signals back and forth with others far away.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (181,1,'Mega Ampharos',6,90,95,105,45,165,110,'Massive amounts of energy intensely stimulated Ampharos''s cells, apparently awakening its long-sleeping dragon''s blood.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (182,0,'Bellossom',2,75,80,95,50,90,100,'Its flower petals deepen in color through exposure to sunlight. When cloudy weather persists, it does a dance that is thought to be a sun-summoning ritual.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (183,0,'Marill',2,70,20,50,40,20,50,'Its body is covered with water-repellent fur. Because of the fur, it can swim through water at high speed without being slowed by the water''s resistance.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (184,0,'Azumarill',2,100,50,80,50,60,80,'It lives in water virtually all day long. Its body color and pattern act as camouflage that makes it tough for enemies to spot in water.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (185,0,'Sudowoodo',2,70,100,115,30,30,65,'It mimics a tree to avoid being attacked by enemies. But since its forelegs remain green throughout the year, it is easily identified as a fake in the winter.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (186,0,'Politoed',2,90,75,75,70,90,100,'The curled hair on its head proves its status as a king. It is said that the longer and curlier the hair, the more respect it earns from its peers.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (187,0,'Hoppip',2,35,35,40,50,35,55,'This Pokemon drifts and floats with the wind. If it senses the approach of strong winds, a Hoppip links leaves with others to prepare against being blown away.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (188,0,'Skiploom',2,55,45,50,80,45,65,'It blossoms when the temperature rises above 64 degrees F. Because its flower''s blooming changes with the temperature, it is sometimes used as a thermometer.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (189,0,'Jumpluff',2,75,55,70,110,55,95,'Jumpluff ride warm southern winds to cross the sea and fly to foreign lands. This Pokemon lands when it encounters cold air while it is floating.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (190,0,'Aipom',2,55,70,55,85,40,55,'Its tail ends with a dexterous, handlike appendage. However, because it uses the tail so much, Aipom''s real hands have become rather clumsy.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (191,0,'Sunkern',2,30,30,30,30,30,30,'Sunkern try to minimize movement to conserve the nutrients they have stored in their bodies for evolution. They will not eat, subsisting only on morning dew.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (192,0,'Sunflora',2,75,75,55,30,105,85,'Sunflora convert solar energy into nutrition. They are highly active in the warm daytime but suddenly stop moving as soon as the sun sets.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (193,0,'Yanma',2,65,65,45,95,75,45,'It can see 360 degrees without moving its eyes. It is a great flier capable of making sudden stops and turning midair to quickly chase down targeted prey.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (194,0,'Wooper',2,55,45,45,15,25,25,'Wooper usually live in water but come out onto land seeking food occasionally. On land, they coat their bodies with a gooey, toxic film.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (195,0,'Quagsire',2,95,85,85,35,65,65,'A Quagsire hunts by leaving its mouth wide open in water and waiting for its prey to blunder in. Because it doesn''t move, it does not get very hungry.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (196,0,'Espeon',2,65,65,60,110,130,95,'An Espeon is extremely loyal to any trainer it considers to be worthy. It is said to have developed precognitive powers to protect its trainer from harm.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (197,0,'Umbreon',2,95,65,110,65,60,130,'Umbreon evolved from exposure to the moon''s energy pulses. It lurks in darkness and waits for its foes to move. The rings on its body glow when it leaps to attack.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (198,0,'Murkrow',2,60,85,42,91,85,42,'Murkrow were feared as the alleged bearers of ill fortune. It shows strong interest in anything that sparkles. It will even try to steal rings from women.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (199,0,'Slowking',2,95,75,80,30,100,110,'It undertakes research every day to solve the mysteries of the world. However, it apparently forgets everything if the Shellder on its head comes off.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (199,1,'Galarian Slowking',8,95,65,80,30,110,110,'While chanting strange spells, this Pokemon combines its internal toxins with what it''s eaten, creating strange potions.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (200,0,'Misdreavus',2,60,60,60,85,85,85,'A Misdreavus frightens people with a creepy, sobbing cry. It apparently uses its red spheres to absorb the fear of foes as its nutrition.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (201,0,'A Unown',2,48,72,48,48,72,48,'This Pokemon is shaped like ancient text characters. Although research is ongoing, it is a mystery as to which came first, the ancient writings or the various Unown.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (201,1,'B Unown',2,48,72,48,48,72,48,'This Pokemon is shaped like ancient text characters. Although research is ongoing, it is a mystery as to which came first, the ancient writings or the various Unown.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (201,2,'C Unown',2,48,72,48,48,72,48,'This Pokemon is shaped like ancient text characters. Although research is ongoing, it is a mystery as to which came first, the ancient writings or the various Unown.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (201,3,'D Unown',2,48,72,48,48,72,48,'This Pokemon is shaped like ancient text characters. Although research is ongoing, it is a mystery as to which came first, the ancient writings or the various Unown.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (201,4,'E Unown',2,48,72,48,48,72,48,'This Pokemon is shaped like ancient text characters. Although research is ongoing, it is a mystery as to which came first, the ancient writings or the various Unown.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (201,5,'F Unown',2,48,72,48,48,72,48,'This Pokemon is shaped like ancient text characters. Although research is ongoing, it is a mystery as to which came first, the ancient writings or the various Unown.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (201,6,'G Unown',2,48,72,48,48,72,48,'This Pokemon is shaped like ancient text characters. Although research is ongoing, it is a mystery as to which came first, the ancient writings or the various Unown.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (201,7,'H Unown',2,48,72,48,48,72,48,'This Pokemon is shaped like ancient text characters. Although research is ongoing, it is a mystery as to which came first, the ancient writings or the various Unown.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (201,8,'I Unown',2,48,72,48,48,72,48,'This Pokemon is shaped like ancient text characters. Although research is ongoing, it is a mystery as to which came first, the ancient writings or the various Unown.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (201,9,'J Unown',2,48,72,48,48,72,48,'This Pokemon is shaped like ancient text characters. Although research is ongoing, it is a mystery as to which came first, the ancient writings or the various Unown.');
