INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (202,0,'Wobbuffet',2,190,33,58,33,33,58,'Usually docile, a Wobbuffet strikes back ferociously if its black tail is attacked. It makes its lair in caves where it waits for nightfall.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (203,0,'Girafarig',2,70,80,65,85,90,65,'A Girafarig is an herbivore--it eats grass and tree shoots. While it is eating, its tail makes chewing and swallowing motions as if it were also eating.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (204,0,'Pineco',2,50,65,90,15,35,35,'A Pineco hangs from a tree branch and waits for prey. While eating, if it is disturbed by someone shaking its tree, it falls on the ground and explodes.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (205,0,'Forretress',2,75,90,140,40,60,60,'It keeps itself inside its steel shell. The shell is opened when it is catching prey, but it is so quick that the shell''s inside cannot be seen.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (206,0,'Dunsparce',2,100,70,70,45,65,65,'Its drill-tipped tail is used to burrow into the ground backwards. This Pokemon is known to make its nest in complex shapes deep under the ground.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (207,0,'Gligar',2,65,75,105,85,35,65,'It glides without making a single sound. It grasps the face of its foe using its hind and large front claws, then stabs with its poison barb.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (208,0,'Steelix',2,75,85,200,30,55,65,'Steelix live even further underground than Onix. This Pokemon is known to dig toward the earth''s core, reaching a depth of over six-tenths of a mile underground.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (208,1,'Mega Steelix',6,75,125,230,30,55,95,'Steelix live even further underground than Onix. This Pokemon is known to dig toward the earth''s core, reaching a depth of over six-tenths of a mile underground.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (209,0,'Snubbull',2,60,80,50,30,40,40,'By baring its fangs and making a scary face, it sends smaller Pokemon scurrying in terror. The Snubbull does seem a little sad at making its foes flee.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (210,0,'Granbull',2,90,120,75,45,60,60,'It has a particularly well-developed lower jaw. The huge fangs are heavy, causing it to tilt its head. Unless it is startled, it will not try to bite.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (211,0,'Qwilfish',2,65,95,85,85,55,55,'A Qwilfish uses the pressure of water it swallows to shoot toxic quills all at once from all over its body. It finds swimming to be somewhat challenging.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (212,0,'Scizor',2,70,130,100,65,55,80,'A Scizor has a body with the hardness of steel. It is not easily fazed by ordinary sorts of attacks. It flaps its wings to regulate its body temperature.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (212,1,'Mega Scizor',6,70,150,140,65,100,75,'It''s better at beating things than grasping them. When it battles for a long time, the weight of its pincers becomes too much to bear.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (213,0,'Shuckle',2,20,10,230,5,10,230,'A Shuckle hides under rocks, keeping its body concealed inside its shell while eating stored berries. The berries mix with its body fluids to become a juice.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (214,0,'Heracross',2,80,125,75,85,40,95,'They gather in forests seeking the sweet sap of trees. It is completely clad in a steel-hard shell. It is proud of its horn, which it uses to fling foes.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (214,1,'Mega Heracross',6,80,185,115,75,40,105,'A tremendous influx of energy builds it up, but when Mega Evolution ends, Heracross is bothered by terrible soreness in its muscles.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (215,0,'Sneasel',2,55,95,55,115,35,75,'A Sneasel scales trees by punching its hooked claws into the bark. It seeks out unguarded nests and steals eggs for food while the parents are away.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (216,0,'Teddiursa',2,60,80,50,40,50,50,'It licks its palms that are sweetened by being soaked in honey. A Teddiursa makes its own honey by blending fruits and pollen collected by Beedrill.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (217,0,'Ursaring',2,90,130,75,55,75,75,'In forests, it is said that there are many streams and towering trees where an Ursaring gathers food. It walks through its forest collecting food every day.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (218,0,'Slugma',2,40,40,40,20,70,40,'It is a species of Pokemon that lives in volcanic areas. If its body cools, its skin hardens and immobilizes it. To avoid that, it sleeps near magma.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (219,0,'Magcargo',2,60,50,120,30,90,80,'The shell on its back is made of hardened magma. Tens of thousands of years spent living in volcanic craters have turned Magcargo''s bodies into magma.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (220,0,'Swinub',2,50,50,40,50,30,30,'It roots for food by rubbing its snout against the ground. Its favorite food is a mushroom that grows under dried grass. It occasionally roots out hot springs.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (221,0,'Piloswine',2,100,100,80,50,60,60,'A Piloswine is covered by a thick coat of long hair for enduring freezing cold. It uses its tusks to dig up food that has been buried under ice.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (222,0,'Corsola',2,65,55,95,35,65,95,'Corsola live in warm southern seas. If the sea becomes polluted, the beautiful coral stalks become discolored and crumble away in tatters.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (222,1,'Galarian Corsola',8,60,55,100,30,65,100,'Sudden climate change wiped out this ancient kind of Corsola. This Pokemon absorbs others'' life-force through its branches.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (223,0,'Remoraid',2,35,65,35,65,65,35,'A Remoraid uses its abdominal muscles to forcefully expel swallowed water, then shoot down flying prey. When evolution approaches, it travels down rivers.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (224,0,'Octillery',2,75,105,75,45,105,75,'It ensnares its foe with its suction- cupped tentacles before delivering the finishing blow. If the foe turns out to be too strong, it spews ink to escape.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (225,0,'Delibird',2,45,55,45,75,65,45,'It carries food bundled up in its tail. There was a famous explorer who managed to scale Mt. Everest thanks to a Delibird sharing its food.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (226,0,'Mantine',2,85,40,70,70,80,140,'On sunny days, schools of Mantine can be seen elegantly leaping over the waves. It is not bothered by the Remoraid that hitches rides.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (227,0,'Skarmory',2,65,80,140,70,40,70,'A Pokemon that has a body and wings of steel. People in the past used feathers fallen from Skarmory to make swords and knives.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (228,0,'Houndour',2,45,60,30,65,80,50,'Houndour communicate with each other using a variety of cries to corner their prey. This Pokemon''s remarkable teamwork is simply unparalleled.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (229,0,'Houndoom',2,75,90,50,95,110,80,'In a Houndoom pack, the one with its horns raked sharply back serves a leadership role. They choose their leader by fighting among themselves.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (229,1,'Mega Houndoom',6,75,90,90,115,140,90,'Its red claws and the tips of its tail are melting from high internal temperatures that are painful to Houndoom itself.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (230,0,'Kingdra',2,75,95,95,85,95,95,'It sleeps quietly, deep on the seafloor. When it comes up to the surface, it creates a huge whirlpool that can swallow even ships.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (231,0,'Phanpy',2,90,60,60,40,40,40,'Phanpy''s big ears serve as broad fans. When it becomes hot, it flaps the ears busily to cool down. Even the young are very strong.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (232,0,'Donphan',2,90,120,120,50,60,60,'A Donphan is so strong it can easily haul a dump truck. Its hide has toughened to a rock-hard state. An ordinary sort of attack won''t even leave a scratch.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (233,0,'Porygon2',2,85,80,90,60,105,95,'It was created by humans using the power of science. It has been given artificial intelligence that enables it to learn new gestures and emotions on its own.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (234,0,'Stantler',2,73,95,62,85,85,65,'Stantler''s magnificent antlers were once traded at high prices as works of art. As a result, this Pokemon was hunted close to extinction.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (235,0,'Smeargle',2,55,20,35,75,20,45,'A Smeargle marks its territory using a fluid that leaks out from the tip of its tail. About 5,000 different marks left by this Pokemon have been found.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (236,0,'Tyrogue',2,35,35,35,35,35,35,'Tyrogue become stressed out if they do not get to train every day. When raising this Pokemon, the trainer must establish a regular training schedule.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (237,0,'Hitmontop',2,50,95,95,70,35,110,'Its technique of kicking while spinning is a remarkable mix of both offense and defense. Hitmontop travel faster spinning than they do walking.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (238,0,'Smoochum',2,45,30,15,65,85,65,'It actively runs about, but also falls often. Whenever it falls, it will check its reflection on a lake''s surface to make sure its face hasn''t become dirty.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (239,0,'Elekid',2,45,63,37,95,65,55,'If it touches metal and discharges the electricity it has stored in its body, an Elekid begins swinging its arms in circles to recharge itself.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (240,0,'Magby',2,45,75,37,83,70,55,'If a Magby is spouting yellow flames from its mouth, it is in good health. When it is fatigued, black smoke will be mixed in with the flames.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (241,0,'Miltank',2,95,80,105,100,40,70,'It gives over five gallons of milk daily. Its sweet milk is enjoyed by children and adults alike. People who can''t drink milk turn it into yogurt and eat it instead.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (242,0,'Blissey',2,255,10,10,55,75,135,'If it senses sadness with its fluffy fur, a Blissey will rush over to the sad person, however far away, to share an egg of happiness that brings a smile to any face.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (243,0,'Raikou',2,90,85,75,115,115,100,'Raikou embodies the speed of lightning. Its roars send shock waves shuddering through the air and ground as if lightning bolts were crashing down.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (244,0,'Entei',2,115,115,85,100,90,75,'Entei embodies the passion of magma. It is thought to have been born in the eruption of a volcano. It blasts fire that consumes all that it touches.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (245,0,'Suicune',2,100,75,115,85,90,115,'Suicune embodies the compassion of a pure spring of water. It runs across the land with gliding elegance. It has the power to purify dirty water.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (246,0,'Larvitar',2,50,64,50,41,45,50,'A Larvitar is born deep under the ground. It must eat its way through the soil above and reach the surface for it to see its parents'' faces.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (247,0,'Pupitar',2,70,84,70,51,65,70,'A Pupitar creates a gas inside its body that it ejects under compression to propel itself like a jet. Its body can withstand a collision with solid steel.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (248,0,'Tyranitar',2,100,134,110,61,95,100,'A Tyranitar is so overwhelmingly powerful, it can bring down a whole mountain to make its nest. It roams in mountains seeking new opponents to fight.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (248,1,'Mega Tyranitar',6,100,164,150,71,95,120,'Due to the colossal power poured into it, this Pokemon''s back split right open. Its destructive instincts are the only thing keeping it moving.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (249,0,'Lugia',2,106,90,130,110,90,154,'Lugia is so powerful even a light fluttering of its wings can blow apart houses. As a result, it chooses to live out of sight deep under the sea.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (250,0,'Ho-Oh',2,106,130,90,90,110,154,'Its feathers--which glow in seven colors depending on the angle at which light strikes them--are thought to bring joy. It is said to live at the foot of a rainbow.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (251,0,'Celebi',2,100,100,100,100,100,100,'This Pokemon came from the future by crossing over time. It is thought that so long as Celebi appears, a bright and shining future awaits us.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (252,0,'Treecko',3,40,45,35,70,65,55,'It makes its nest in a giant tree in the forest. It ferociously guards against anything nearing its territory. It is said to be the protector of the trees.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (253,0,'Grovyle',3,50,65,45,95,85,65,'Leaves grow out of this Pokemon''s body. They help obscure a Grovyle from the eyes of its enemies while it is in a thickly overgrown forest.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (254,0,'Sceptile',3,70,85,65,120,105,85,'In the jungle, its power is without equal. This Pokemon carefully grows trees and plants. It regulates its body temperature by basking in sunlight.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (254,1,'Mega Sceptile',6,70,110,75,145,145,85,'In the jungle, its power is without equal. This Pokemon carefully grows trees and plants. It regulates its body temperature by basking in sunlight.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (255,0,'Torchic',3,45,60,40,45,70,50,'If attacked, it strikes back by spitting balls of fire it forms in its stomach. A Torchic dislikes darkness because it can''t see its surroundings.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (256,0,'Combusken',3,60,85,60,55,85,60,'It lashes out with 10 kicks per second. Its strong fighting instinct compels it to keep up its offensive until the opponent gives up.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (257,0,'Blaziken',3,80,120,70,80,110,70,'It learns martial arts that use punches and kicks. Every several years, its old feathers burn off, and new, supple feathers grow back in their place.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (257,1,'Mega Blaziken',6,80,160,80,100,130,80,'It learns martial arts that use punches and kicks. Every several years, its old feathers burn off, and new, supple feathers grow back in their place.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (258,0,'Mudkip',3,50,70,50,40,50,50,'On land, it can powerfully lift large boulders by planting its four feet and heaving. It sleeps by burying itself in soil at the water''s edge.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (259,0,'Marshtomp',3,70,85,70,50,60,70,'Its toughened hind legs enable it to stand upright. Because it weakens if its skin dries out, it replenishes fluids by playing in mud.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (260,0,'Swampert',3,100,110,90,60,85,90,'If it senses the approach of a storm and a tidal wave, it protects its seaside nest by piling up boulders. It swims as fast as a jet ski.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (260,1,'Mega Swampert',6,100,150,110,70,95,110,'If it senses the approach of a storm and a tidal wave, it protects its seaside nest by piling up boulders. It swims as fast as a jet ski.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (261,0,'Poochyena',3,35,55,35,35,30,30,'It savagely threatens foes with bared fangs. It chases after fleeing targets tenaciously. It turns tail and runs, however, if the foe strikes back.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (262,0,'Mightyena',3,70,90,70,70,60,60,'In the wild, Mightyena live in a pack. They never defy their leader''s orders. They defeat foes with perfectly coordinated teamwork.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (263,0,'Zigzagoon',3,38,30,41,60,30,41,'Rubbing its nose against the ground, it always wanders about back and forth in search of something. It is distinguished by the zigzag footprints it leaves.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (263,1,'Galarian Zigzagoon',8,38,30,41,60,30,41,'Its restlessness has it constantly running around. If it sees another Pokemon, it will purposely run into them in order to start a fight.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (264,0,'Linoone',3,78,70,61,100,50,61,'It is exceedingly fast if it only has to run in a straight line. When it spots pond- dwelling prey underwater, it quickly leaps in and catches it with its sharp claws.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (264,1,'Galarian Linoone',8,78,70,61,100,50,61,'It uses its long tongue to taunt opponents. Once the opposition is enraged, this Pokemon hurls itself at the opponent, tackling them forcefully.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (265,0,'Wurmple',3,45,45,35,20,20,30,'It sticks to tree branches and eats leaves. The thread it spits from its mouth becomes gooey when it touches air and slows the movement of its foes.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (266,0,'Silcoon',3,50,35,55,15,25,25,'It prepares for evolution using the energy it stored while it was a Wurmple. It keeps watch over the surroundings with its two eyes.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (267,0,'Beautifly',3,60,70,50,65,100,50,'Its colorfully patterned wings are its most prominent feature. It flies through flower-covered fields collecting pollen. It attacks ferociously when angered.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (268,0,'Cascoon',3,50,35,55,15,25,25,'To avoid detection by its enemies, it hides motionlessly beneath large leaves and in the gaps of branches. It also attaches dead leaves to its body for camouflage.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (269,0,'Dustox',3,60,50,70,65,50,90,'It is a nocturnal Pokemon that flies from fields and mountains to the attraction of streetlights at night. It looses highly toxic powder from its wings.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (270,0,'Lotad',3,40,30,30,30,40,50,'This Pokemon lives in ponds with clean water. It is known to ferry small Pokemon across ponds by carrying them on the broad leaf on its head.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (271,0,'Lombre',3,60,50,50,50,60,70,'In the evening, it takes great delight in popping out of rivers and startling people. It feeds on aquatic moss that grows on rocks in the riverbed.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (272,0,'Ludicolo',3,80,70,70,70,90,100,'When it hears festive music, all the cells in its body become stimulated, and it begins moving in rhythm. It does not quail even when it faces a tough opponent.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (273,0,'Seedot',3,40,40,50,30,30,30,'It hangs off branches and absorbs nutrients. When it finishes eating, its body becomes so heavy that it drops to the ground with a thump.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (274,0,'Nuzleaf',3,70,70,40,60,60,40,'A forest-dwelling Pokemon that is skilled at climbing trees. Its long and pointed nose is its weak point. It loses power if the nose is gripped.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (275,0,'Shiftry',3,90,100,60,80,90,60,'It is said to arrive on chilly, wintry winds. Feared from long ago as the guardian of forests, this Pokemon lives in a deep forest where people do not venture.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (276,0,'Taillow',3,40,55,30,85,30,30,'Although it is small, it is very courageous. It will take on a larger Skarmory on an equal footing. However, its will weakens if it becomes hungry.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (277,0,'Swellow',3,60,85,60,125,75,50,'A Swellow dives upon prey from far above. It never misses its targets. It takes to the skies in search of lands with a warm climate.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (278,0,'Wingull',3,40,30,30,85,55,30,'It makes its nest on a sheer cliff at the edge of the sea. It has trouble keeping its wings flapping in flight. Instead, it soars on updrafts.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (279,0,'Pelipper',3,60,50,100,65,95,70,'It skims the tops of waves as it flies. When it spots prey, it uses its large beak to scoop up the victim with water. It protects its eggs in its beak.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (280,0,'Ralts',3,28,25,25,40,45,35,'A Ralts has the power to sense the emotions of people and Pokemon with the horns on its head. It takes cover if it senses any hostility.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (281,0,'Kirlia',3,38,35,35,50,65,55,'A Kirlia has the psychic power to create a rip in the dimensions and see into the future. It is said to dance with pleasure on sunny mornings.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (282,0,'Gardevoir',3,68,65,65,80,125,115,'It apparently does not feel the pull of gravity because it supports itself with psychic power. It will give its life to protect its trainer.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (282,1,'Mega Gardevoir',6,68,85,65,100,165,135,'It apparently does not feel the pull of gravity because it supports itself with psychic power. It will give its life to protect its trainer.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (283,0,'Surskit',3,40,30,32,65,50,52,'They gather on puddles after evening downpours, gliding across the surface of water as if sliding. It secretes honey with a sweet aroma from its head.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (284,0,'Masquerain',3,70,60,62,80,100,82,'It intimidates foes with the large eyelike patterns on its antennae. Because it can''t fly if its wings get wet, it shelters from rain under large trees and eaves.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (285,0,'Shroomish',3,60,40,60,35,40,60,'It loves to eat damp, composted soil in forests. If you enter a forest after a long rain, you can see many Shroomish feasting on composted soil.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (286,0,'Breloom',3,60,130,80,70,60,60,'It scatters spores from holes in the cap on its head. It loves warm and humid climates. It feeds on trees and plants in fields and forests.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (287,0,'Slakoth',3,60,60,60,30,35,35,'It sleeps virtually all day and night long. It doesn''t change its nest its entire life, but it sometimes travels great distances by swimming in rivers.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (288,0,'Vigoroth',3,80,80,80,90,55,55,'It can''t keep still because its blood boils with energy. It runs through the fields and mountains all day to calm itself. If it doesn''t, it can''t sleep at night.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (289,0,'Slaking',3,150,160,100,100,95,65,'Hordes of Slaking gather around trees when fruits come into season. They wait around patiently for ripened fruits to fall out of the trees.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (290,0,'Nincada',3,31,45,90,40,30,30,'It makes its nest at the roots of a mighty tree. Using its whiskerlike antennae, it probes its surroundings in the pitch-black darkness of soil.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (291,0,'Ninjask',3,61,90,45,160,50,50,'Because it darts about vigorously at high speed, it is very difficult to see. Hearing its distinctive cries for too long induces a headache.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (292,0,'Shedinja',3,1,90,45,40,30,30,'A peculiar Pokemon that floats in air even though its wings remain completely still. The inside of its body is hollow and utterly dark.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (293,0,'Whismur',3,64,51,23,28,51,23,'Its cries equal a jet plane in volume. It inhales through its ear canals. Because of this system, it can cry continually without having to catch its breath.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (294,0,'Loudred',3,84,71,43,48,71,43,'It positions the round speakers on its head to assail foes with ultrasonic waves at massive volume. It builds power by stomping the ground.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (295,0,'Exploud',3,104,91,63,68,91,73,'It has sound-generating organs all over its body. It communicates with others by adjusting the tone and volume of the cries it emits.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (296,0,'Makuhita',3,72,60,30,25,20,30,'It loves to toughen up its body above all else. If you hear quaking rumbles in a cave, it is the sound of Makuhita undertaking strenuous training.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (297,0,'Hariyama',3,144,120,60,50,40,60,'It has the habit of challenging others without hesitation to tests of strength. It''s been known to stand on train tracks and stop trains using forearm thrusts.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (298,0,'Azurill',3,50,20,40,20,20,40,'Its tail, which is packed with nutrition, is very bouncy like a rubber ball. On sunny days they gather at the edge of water and splash about for fun.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (299,0,'Nosepass',3,30,45,135,30,45,90,'Its body emits a powerful magnetism. It feeds on prey that is pulled in by the force. Its magnetism is stronger in cold seasons.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (300,0,'Skitty',3,50,45,45,50,35,35,'A Skitty''s adorably cute behavior makes it highly popular. In battle, it makes its tail puff out. It threatens foes with a sharp growl.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (301,0,'Delcatty',3,70,65,65,90,55,55,'Rather than keeping a permanent lair, it habitually seeks comfortable spots and sleeps there. It is nocturnal and becomes active at dusk.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (302,0,'Sableye',3,50,75,75,50,65,65,'It digs branching holes in caves using its sharp claws in search of food--raw gems. A Sableye lurks in darkness and is seen only rarely.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (302,1,'Mega Sableye',6,50,85,125,20,85,115,'Supporting a giant heavy jewel, it can''t change direction very nimbly and is vulnerable to attack from behind.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (303,0,'Mawile',3,50,85,85,50,55,55,'Its giant jaws are actually steel horns that transformed. It fools foes into complacency with its adorable gestures, then chomps them with its huge jaws.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (303,1,'Mega Mawile',6,50,105,125,50,55,95,'Its two sets of jaws thrash about violently as if they each had a will of their own. One gnash from them can turn a boulder to dust.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (304,0,'Aron',3,50,70,100,30,40,40,'A Pokemon that is clad in steel armor. A new suit of armor is made when it evolves. The old, discarded armor is salvaged as metal for making iron products.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (305,0,'Lairon',3,60,90,140,40,50,50,'When two Lairon meet in the wild, they fight for territory by bashing into each other with their steel bodies. The sound of their collision carries for miles.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (306,0,'Aggron',3,70,110,180,50,60,60,'Its iron horns grow longer a little at a time. They are used to determine the Aggron''s age. The gouges in its armor are worn with pride as mementos from battles.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (306,1,'Mega Aggron',6,70,140,230,50,60,80,'Its iron horns grow longer a little at a time. They are used to determine the Aggron''s age. The gouges in its armor are worn with pride as mementos from battles.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (307,0,'Meditite',3,30,40,55,60,40,55,'It continually meditates for hours every day. As a result of rigorous and dedicated yoga training, it has tempered its spiritual power so much it can fly.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (308,0,'Medicham',3,60,60,75,80,60,75,'Through crushingly harsh yoga training, it gained the power to foretell its foe''s actions. It battles with elegant, dance- like movement.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (308,1,'Mega Medicham',6,60,100,85,100,80,85,'Through crushingly harsh yoga training, it gained the power to foretell its foe''s actions. It battles with elegant, dance- like movement.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (309,0,'Electrike',3,40,45,40,65,65,40,'It generates electricity using friction from the atmosphere. In seasons with especially arid air, its entire body blazes with violent showers of sparks.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (310,0,'Manectric',3,70,75,60,105,105,60,'Because lightning falls in their vicinities, Manectric were thought to have been born from lightning. In battle, they create thunderclouds.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (310,1,'Mega Manectric',6,70,75,80,135,135,80,'Too much electricity has built up in its body, irritating Manectric. Its explosive speed is equal to that of a lightning bolt.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (311,0,'Plusle',3,60,50,40,95,85,75,'It has the trait of cheering on its fellow Pokemon. By shorting out the electricity it releases from its paws, it creates pom-poms for cheering.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (312,0,'Minun',3,60,40,50,95,75,85,'At a meeting of Pokemon academics, it was announced that simultaneous exposure to electricity from a Plusle and Minun will promote circulation and boost vitality.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (313,0,'Volbeat',3,65,73,75,85,47,85,'With their taillights lit, Volbeat fly in a swarm, drawing geometric designs in the night sky. They move their nests if their pond water becomes dirty.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (314,0,'Illumise',3,65,47,75,85,73,85,'A nocturnal Pokemon that becomes active upon nightfall. It leads a Volbeat swarm to draw patterns in the night sky. Over 200 different patterns have been seen.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (315,0,'Roselia',3,50,60,45,65,100,80,'A Roselia that drinks nutritionally rich springwater blooms with lovely flowers. The fragrance of its flowers has the effect of making its foes careless.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (316,0,'Gulpin',3,70,43,53,40,43,53,'This Pokemon''s stomach fluid can even digest scrap iron. In one gulp, it can swallow something that is as large as itself.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (317,0,'Swalot',3,100,73,83,55,73,83,'Its powerful stomach acid is capable of digesting almost anything. The one thing in the whole world a Swalot can''t digest is its own stomach.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (318,0,'Carvanha',3,45,90,20,65,65,20,'Carvanha attack ships in swarms, making them sink. Although it is said to be a very vicious Pokemon, it timidly flees as soon as it finds itself alone.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (319,0,'Sharpedo',3,70,120,40,95,95,40,'The vicious and sly gangster of the sea. Its skin is specially textured to minimize drag in water. Its speed tops out at over 75 miles per hour.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (319,1,'Mega Sharpedo',6,70,140,70,105,110,65,'The yellow patterns it bears are old scars. The energy from Mega Evolution runs through them, causing it sharp pain and suffering.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (320,0,'Wailmer',3,130,70,35,60,70,35,'While this Pokemon usually lives in the sea, it can survive on land, although not too long. It loses vitality if its body becomes dried out.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (321,0,'Wailord',3,170,90,45,60,90,45,'It breathes through nostrils that it raises above the sea. By inhaling to its maximum capacity, a Wailord can dive close to 10,000 feet beneath the waves.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (322,0,'Numel',3,60,60,40,35,65,45,'A Numel stores boiling magma in the hump on its back. It is a hardy Pokemon that can transport a 220-pound load. It has served humans at work since long ago.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (323,0,'Camerupt',3,70,100,70,40,105,75,'A Pokemon that lives in the crater of a volcano. Every 10 years, the volcanoes on its back erupt violently. Research is under way on the cause of eruption.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (323,1,'Mega Camerupt',6,70,120,100,20,145,105,'A Pokemon that lives in the crater of a volcano. Every 10 years, the volcanoes on its back erupt violently. Research is under way on the cause of eruption.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (324,0,'Torkoal',3,70,85,140,20,85,70,'It battles using energy it gets from burning coal. When loosing smoke from its nostrils, it lets off a sound that is similar to a locomotive''s horn.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (325,0,'Spoink',3,60,25,35,60,70,80,'A Pokemon that manipulates psychic power at will. It doesn''t stop bouncing even when it is asleep. It loves eating mushrooms that grow underground.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (326,0,'Grumpig',3,80,45,65,80,90,110,'It stores power in the black pearls on its forehead. When it uses psychic power, it performs an odd dance step. Its style of dancing became hugely popular overseas.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (327,0,'Spinda',3,60,60,60,60,60,60,'It is distinguished by a pattern of spots that is always different. Its unsteady, tottering walk has the effect of fouling its foe''s aim.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (328,0,'Trapinch',3,45,100,45,10,45,45,'Its big jaws crunch through boulders. Because its head is so big, it has a hard time getting back upright if it tips over onto its back.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (329,0,'Vibrava',3,50,70,50,70,50,50,'It looses ultrasonic waves by rubbing its wings together. Since a Vibrava''s wings are still in the process of growing, it can only fly short distances.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (330,0,'Flygon',3,80,100,80,100,80,80,'The flapping of its wings sounds like singing. To prevent detection by enemies, it hides itself by flapping up a cloud of desert sand.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (331,0,'Cacnea',3,50,85,40,35,85,40,'Cacnea live in deserts with virtually no rainfall. It battles by swinging its thick, spiked arms. Once a year, a yellow flower blooms.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (332,0,'Cacturne',3,70,115,60,55,115,60,'After spending thousands of years in harsh deserts, its blood transformed into the same substances as sand. It is nocturnal, so it hunts at night.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (333,0,'Swablu',3,45,40,60,50,40,75,'A Pokemon that has wings like cottony clouds. After enduring winter, in which little food is available, Swablu flocks move closer to towns in the spring.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (334,0,'Altaria',3,75,70,90,80,70,105,'It hums in a beautiful soprano voice. It flies among white clouds in the blue sky. It launches intensely hot fireballs from its mouth.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (334,1,'Mega Altaria',6,75,110,110,80,110,105,'It hums in a beautiful soprano voice. It flies among white clouds in the blue sky. It launches intensely hot fireballs from its mouth.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (335,0,'Zangoose',3,73,115,60,90,60,60,'When it battles, it stands on its hind legs and attacks with its sharply clawed forelegs. Its fur bristles if it encounters any Seviper.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (336,0,'Seviper',3,73,100,60,65,100,60,'Seviper and Zangoose are eternal rivals. It counters a Zangoose''s dazzling agility with its swordlike tail, which also oozes a horrible poison.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (337,0,'Lunatone',3,90,55,65,70,95,85,'It becomes very active on the night of a full moon. This Pokemon was first discovered 40 years ago at the site of a meteor strike.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (338,0,'Solrock',3,90,95,85,70,55,65,'Solar energy is the source of this Pokemon''s power. On sunny days, groups of Solrock line up facing the sun and absorb its light.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (339,0,'Barboach',3,50,48,43,60,46,41,'Its body is covered with a slimy film. The film acts as a barrier to prevent germs in muddy water from entering the Barboach''s body.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (340,0,'Whiscash',3,110,78,73,60,76,71,'Mysteriously, it can foretell earthquakes. In the daytime, it sleeps in mud at the bottom of a pond. When it awakens, it continually feeds throughout the night.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (341,0,'Corphish',3,43,80,65,35,50,35,'Once it grips prey with its large pincers, it will never let go, no matter what. It is a hardy Pokemon that can thrive in any environment.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (342,0,'Crawdaunt',3,63,120,85,55,90,55,'A brutish Pokemon that loves to battle. A veteran Crawdaunt that has prevailed in hundreds of battles has giant pincers marked with countless scars.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (343,0,'Baltoy',3,40,40,55,55,40,70,'A Baltoy moves by spinning on its single foot. It has been depicted in murals adorning the walls of a once-bustling city in an ancient age.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (344,0,'Claydol',3,60,70,105,75,70,120,'A Claydol sleeps while hovering in midair. Its arms are separate from its body. They are kept floating by the Pokemon''s manipulation of psychic power.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (345,0,'Lileep',3,66,41,77,23,61,87,'It disguises itself as seaweed by making its tentacles sway. Unsuspecting prey that come too close are swallowed whole. It became extinct 100 million years ago.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (346,0,'Cradily',3,86,81,97,43,81,107,'It drags its heavy body along the seafloor. It makes its nest in the shallows of warm seas. Cradily can be seen on beaches when the tide goes out.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (347,0,'Anorith',3,45,95,50,75,40,50,'It was resurrected from a fossil using the power of science. It swims by undulating the wings at its sides. They were feet that adapted to life in the sea.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (348,0,'Armaldo',3,75,125,100,45,70,80,'Armaldo usually lives on land. However, when it hunts for prey, it dives beneath the ocean. It swims around using its two large wings.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (349,0,'Feebas',3,20,15,20,80,10,55,'Feebas live in ponds that are heavily infested with weeds. Because of its hopelessly shabby appearance, it seems as if few trainers raise it.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (350,0,'Milotic',3,95,60,79,81,100,125,'It is said to live at the bottom of large lakes. Considered to be the most beautiful of all Pokemon, it has been depicted in paintings and statues.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (351,0,'Normal Form Castform',3,70,70,70,70,70,70,'It alters its form depending on the weather. Changes in the climate such as the temperature and humidity appear to affect its cellular structure.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (351,1,'Sunny Form Castform',3,70,70,70,70,70,70,'This is the form Castform takes on the brightest of days. Its skin is unexpectedly hot to the touch, so approach with care.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (351,2,'Rainy Form Castform',3,70,70,70,70,70,70,'This is the form Castform takes when soaked with rain. When its body is compressed, water will seep out as if from a sponge.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (351,3,'Snowy Form Castform',3,70,70,70,70,70,70,'This is the form Castform takes when covered in snow. Its body becomes an ice-like material, with a temperature near -5 degrees Celsius.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (352,0,'Kecleon',3,60,90,70,40,60,120,'A Pokemon that has the ability to alter its body colors to match its surroundings. A Kecleon reverts to its original colors if it is startled.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (353,0,'Shuppet',3,44,75,35,45,63,33,'This Pokemon roams about deep in the night seeking such negative emotions as grudges and envy. It retreats to its nest when the sun begins to rise.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (354,0,'Banette',3,64,115,65,65,83,63,'An abandoned plush doll became this Pokemon. They are said to live in garbage dumps and wander about in search of the children that threw them away.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (354,1,'Mega Banette',6,64,165,75,75,93,83,'Extraordinary energy amplifies its cursing power to such an extent that it can''t help but curse its own Trainer.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (355,0,'Duskull',3,20,40,90,25,30,90,'A glare from its single scarlet eye makes even burly grown-ups freeze in utter fear. It is a nocturnal Pokemon that roams about under the cloak of darkness.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (356,0,'Dusclops',3,40,70,130,25,60,130,'It is thought that its body is hollow with only a spectral ball of fire burning inside. However, no one has been able to confirm this theory as fact.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (357,0,'Tropius',3,99,68,83,51,72,87,'It flies by flapping its broad leaves. The bunch of fruit that grows around its neck is deliciously sweet. In the spring, it scatters pollen from its neck.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (358,0,'Chimecho',3,75,50,80,65,95,90,'They fly about very actively when the hot season arrives. They communicate among themselves using seven different and distinguishing cries.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (359,0,'Absol',3,65,130,60,75,75,60,'It sharply senses even subtle changes in the sky and the land to predict natural disasters. It is a long-lived Pokemon that has a life-span of 100 years.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (359,1,'Mega Absol',6,65,150,60,115,115,60,'When this Pokemon whips the winglike fur on its back as though beating its wings, it sends an intimidating aura flying at its opponents.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (360,0,'Wynaut',3,95,23,48,23,23,48,'A Wynaut loves to eat sweet fruits. It cleverly picks fruits using its earlike arms. They gather in fruit gardens, drawn by the fragrance.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (361,0,'Snorunt',3,50,50,50,50,50,50,'They tend to move about in groups of around five Snorunt. In snowy regions, it is said that when they are seen late at night, snowfall will arrive by morning.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (362,0,'Glalie',3,80,80,80,80,80,80,'A Glalie has the power to instantaneously freeze moisture in the atmosphere. A dazzling cloud of diamondlike ice crystals forms around its body.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (362,1,'Mega Glalie',6,80,120,80,100,120,80,'It envelops prey in its mouth, freezing them instantly. But its jaw is dislocated, so it''s unable to eat them.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (363,0,'Spheal',3,70,40,50,25,55,50,'It is completely covered with plushy fur. As a result, it never feels the cold even when it is rolling about on ice floes or diving in the sea.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (364,0,'Sealeo',3,90,60,70,45,75,70,'Sealeo live in herds on ice floes. Using its powerful flippers, it shatters ice. It dives into the sea to hunt prey five times a day.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (365,0,'Walrein',3,110,80,90,65,95,90,'To protect its herd, the leader battles anything that invades its territory, even at the cost of its life. Its tusks may snap off in battle.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (366,0,'Clamperl',3,35,64,85,32,74,55,'A Clamperl slams its shell closed on prey to prevent escape. The pearl it creates upon evolution is said to be infused with a mysterious energy.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (367,0,'Huntail',3,55,104,105,52,94,75,'To withstand the crushing water pressure deep under the sea, its spine is very thick and sturdy. Its tail, which is shaped like a small fish, has eyes that light up.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (368,0,'Gorebyss',3,55,84,105,52,114,75,'A Gorebyss siphons the body fluids of prey through its thin, tubular mouth. Its light pink body color turns vivid when it finishes feeding.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (369,0,'Relicanth',3,100,90,130,55,45,65,'A Pokemon that was once believed to be extinct. The species has not changed its form for 100 million years. It walks on the seafloor using its pectoral fins.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (370,0,'Luvdisc',3,43,30,55,97,40,65,'Luvdisc make the branches of Corsola their nests. There is a custom from long ago of giving a Luvdisc as a gift to express one''s feelings of love.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (371,0,'Bagon',3,45,75,60,50,40,30,'Although it is small, this Pokemon is very powerful because its body is a bundle of muscles. It launches head-butts with its ironlike skull.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (372,0,'Shelgon',3,65,95,100,50,60,50,'It hardly eats while it awaits evolution. It becomes hardier by enduring hunger. Its shell peels off the instant it begins to evolve.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (373,0,'Salamence',3,95,135,80,100,110,80,'After many long years, its cellular structure underwent a sudden mutation to grow wings. When angered, it loses all thought and rampages out of control.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (373,1,'Mega Salamence',6,95,145,130,120,120,90,'It puts its forelegs inside its shell to streamline itself for flight. Salamence flies at high speeds over all kinds of topographical features.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (374,0,'Beldum',3,40,55,80,30,35,60,'When Beldum gather in a swarm, they move in perfect unison as if they were but one Pokemon. They communicate with each other using brain waves.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (375,0,'Metang',3,60,75,100,50,55,80,'The claws tipping its arms pack the destructive power to tear through thick iron sheets as if they were silk. It flies at over 60 miles per hour.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (376,0,'Metagross',3,80,135,130,70,95,90,'Metagross has four brains that are joined by a complex neural network. As a result of integration, this Pokemon is smarter than a supercomputer.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (376,1,'Mega Metagross',6,95,145,130,120,120,90,'Its intellect surpasses its previous level, resulting in battles so cruel, they''ll make you want to cover your eyes.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (377,0,'Regirock',3,80,100,200,50,50,100,'A Pokemon that is made entirely of rocks and boulders. If parts of its body chip off in battle, Regirock repairs itself by adding new rocks.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (378,0,'Regice',3,80,50,100,50,100,200,'Its entire body is made of Antarctic ice. After extensive studies, researchers believe the ice was formed during an ice age.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (379,0,'Registeel',3,80,75,150,50,75,150,'Its body is harder than any other kind of metal. The body metal is composed of a mysterious substance. Not only is it hard, it shrinks and stretches flexibly.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (380,0,'Latias',3,80,80,90,110,110,130,'They make a small herd of only several members. They rarely make contact with people or other Pokemon. They disappear if they sense enemies.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (380,1,'Mega Latias',6,80,100,120,110,140,150,'They make a small herd of only several members. They rarely make contact with people or other Pokemon. They disappear if they sense enemies.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (381,0,'Latios',3,80,90,80,110,130,110,'Even in hiding, it can detect the locations of others and sense their emotions since it has telepathy. Its intelligence allows it to understand human languages.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (381,1,'Mega Latios',6,80,130,100,110,160,120,'Even in hiding, it can detect the locations of others and sense their emotions since it has telepathy. Its intelligence allows it to understand human languages.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (382,0,'Kyogre',3,100,100,90,90,150,140,'Kyogre has appeared in mythology as the creator of the sea. After long years of feuding with Groudon, it took to sleep at the bottom of the sea.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (382,1,'Primal Kyogre',6,100,150,90,90,180,160,'Kyogre has appeared in mythology as the creator of the sea. After long years of feuding with Groudon, it took to sleep at the bottom of the sea.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (383,0,'Groudon',3,100,150,140,90,100,90,'Groudon has appeared in mythology as the creator of the land. It sleeps in magma underground and is said to make volcanoes erupt on awakening.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (383,1,'Primal Groudon',6,100,180,160,90,150,90,'Groudon has appeared in mythology as the creator of the land. It sleeps in magma underground and is said to make volcanoes erupt on awakening.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (384,0,'Rayquaza',3,105,150,90,95,150,90,'A Pokemon that flies endlessly in the ozone layer. It is said it would descend to the ground if Kyogre and Groudon were to fight.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (384,1,'Mega Rayquaza',6,105,150,90,95,150,90,'A Pokemon that flies endlessly in the ozone layer. It is said it would descend to the ground if Kyogre and Groudon were to fight.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (385,0,'Jirachi',3,100,100,100,100,100,100,'Jirachi is said to make wishes come true. While it sleeps, a tough crystalline shell envelops the body to protect it from enemies.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (386,0,'Normal Forme Deoxys',3,50,150,50,150,150,50,'A Pokemon that mutated from an extraterrestrial virus exposed to a laser beam. Its body is configured for superior agility and speed.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (386,1,'Attack Forme Deoxys',3,50,180,20,150,180,20,'A Pokemon that mutated from an extraterrestrial virus exposed to a laser beam. Its body is configured for superior agility and speed.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (386,2,'Defense Forme Deoxys',3,50,70,160,90,70,160,'A Pokemon that mutated from an extraterrestrial virus exposed to a laser beam. Its body is configured for superior agility and speed.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (386,3,'Speed Forme Deoxys',3,50,95,90,180,95,90,'A Pokemon that mutated from an extraterrestrial virus exposed to a laser beam. Its body is configured for superior agility and speed.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (387,0,'Turtwig',4,55,68,64,31,45,55,'Made from soil, the shell on its back hardens when it drinks water. It lives along lakes.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (388,0,'Grotle',4,75,89,85,36,55,65,'It lives along water in forests. In the daytime, it leaves the forest to sunbathe its treed shell.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (389,0,'Torterra',4,95,109,105,56,75,85,'Small Pokemon occasionally gather on its unmoving back to begin building their nests.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (390,0,'Chimchar',4,44,58,44,61,58,44,'It agilely scales sheer cliffs to live atop craggy mountains. Its fire is put out when it sleeps.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (391,0,'Monferno',4,64,78,52,81,78,52,'To intimidate attackers, it stretches the fire on its tail to make itself appear bigger.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (392,0,'Infernape',4,76,104,71,108,104,71,'It uses a special kind of martial arts involving all its limbs. Its fire never goes out.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (393,0,'Piplup',4,53,51,53,40,61,56,'Because it is very proud, it hates accepting food from people. Its thick down guards it from cold.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (394,0,'Prinplup',4,64,66,68,50,81,76,'It lives alone, away from others. Apparently, every one of them believes it is the most important.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (395,0,'Empoleon',4,84,86,88,60,111,101,'The three horns that extend from its beak attest to its power. The leader has the biggest horns.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (396,0,'Starly',4,40,55,30,60,30,30,'They flock in great numbers. Though small, they flap their wings with great power.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (397,0,'Staravia',4,55,75,50,80,40,40,'It flies around forests and fields in search of bug Pokemon. It stays within a huge flock.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (398,0,'Staraptor',4,85,120,70,100,50,60,'It has a savage nature. It will courageously challenge foes that are much larger.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (399,0,'Bidoof',4,59,45,40,31,35,40,'With nerves of steel, nothing can perturb it. It is more agile and active than it appears.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (400,0,'Bibarel',4,79,85,60,71,55,60,'It makes its nest by damming streams with bark and mud. It is known as an industrious worker.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (401,0,'Kricketot',4,37,25,41,25,25,41,'It shakes its head back to front, causing its antennae to hit each other and sound like a xylophone.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (402,0,'Kricketune',4,77,85,51,65,55,51,'It crosses its knifelike arms in front of its chest when it cries. It can compose melodies ad lib.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (403,0,'Shinx',4,45,65,34,45,40,34,'All of its fur dazzles if danger is sensed. It flees while the foe is momentarily blinded.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (404,0,'Luxio',4,60,85,49,60,60,49,'Its claws loose electricity with enough amperage to cause fainting. They live in small groups.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (405,0,'Luxray',4,80,120,79,70,95,79,'It has eyes that can see through anything. It spots and captures prey hiding behind objects.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (406,0,'Budew',4,40,30,35,55,50,70,'Over the winter, it closes its bud and endures the cold. In spring, the bud opens and releases pollen.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (407,0,'Roserade',4,60,70,65,90,125,105,'It attracts prey with a sweet aroma, then downs it with thorny whips hidden in its arms.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (408,0,'Cranidos',4,67,125,40,58,30,30,'It lived in jungles around 100 million years ago. Its skull is as hard as iron.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (409,0,'Rampardos',4,97,165,60,58,65,50,'Its powerful head butt has enough power to shatter even the most durable things upon impact.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (410,0,'Shieldon',4,30,42,118,30,42,88,'A Pokemon that lived in jungles around 100 million years ago. Its facial hide is extremely hard.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (411,0,'Bastiodon',4,60,52,168,30,47,138,'Any frontal attack is repulsed. It is a docile Pokemon that feeds on grass and berries.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (412,0,'Plant Cloak Burmy',4,40,29,45,36,29,45,'To shelter itself from cold, wintry winds, it covers itself with a cloak made of twigs and leaves.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (412,1,'Sandy Cloak Burmy',4,40,29,45,36,29,45,'To shelter itself from cold, wintry winds, it covers itself with a cloak made of twigs and leaves.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (412,2,'Trash Cloak Burmy',4,40,29,45,36,29,45,'To shelter itself from cold, wintry winds, it covers itself with a cloak made of twigs and leaves.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (413,0,'Plant Cloak Wormadam',4,60,59,85,36,79,105,'When Burmy evolved, its cloak became a part of this Pokemon''s body. The cloak is never shed.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (413,1,'Sandy Cloak Wormadam',4,60,79,105,36,59,85,'When Burmy evolved, its cloak became a part of this Pokemon''s body. The cloak is never shed.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (413,2,'Trash Cloak Wormadam',4,60,69,95,36,69,95,'When Burmy evolved, its cloak became a part of this Pokemon''s body. The cloak is never shed.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (414,0,'Mothim',4,70,94,50,66,94,50,'It loves the honey of flowers and steals honey collected by Combee.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (415,0,'Combee',4,30,30,42,70,30,42,'A Pokemon formed by three others. It busily carries sweet floral honey to Vespiquen.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (416,0,'Vespiquen',4,70,80,102,40,80,102,'Its abdomen is a honeycomb for grubs. It raises its grubs on honey collected by Combee.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (417,0,'Pachirisu',4,60,45,70,95,45,90,'It makes fur balls that crackle with static electricity. It stores them with berries in tree holes.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (418,0,'Buizel',4,55,65,35,85,60,30,'It has a flotation sac that is like an inflatable collar. It floats on water with its head out.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (419,0,'Floatzel',4,85,105,55,115,85,50,'It floats using its well-developed flotation sac. It assists in the rescues of drowning people.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (420,0,'Cherubi',4,45,35,45,35,62,53,'The small ball holds the nutrients needed for evolution. Apparently, it is very sweet and tasty.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (421,0,'Overcast Form Cherrim',4,70,60,70,85,87,78,'Its folded petals are pretty tough. Bird Pokemon can peck at them all they want, and Cherrim won''t be bothered at all.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (421,1,'Sunshine Form Cherrim',4,70,60,70,85,87,78,'After absorbing plenty of sunlight, Cherrim takes this form. It''s full of energy while it''s like this, and its liveliness will go on until sundown.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (422,0,'West Sea Shellos',4,76,48,48,34,57,62,'This Pokemon''s habitat shapes its physique. According to some theories, life in warm ocean waters causes this variation to develop.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (422,1,'East Sea Shellos',4,76,48,48,34,57,62,'Its appearance changes depending on the environment. One theory suggests that living in cold seas causes Shellos to take on this form.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (423,0,'West Sea Gastrodon',4,111,83,68,39,92,82,'Its search for food sometimes leads it onto land, where it leaves behind a sticky trail of slime as it passes through.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (423,1,'East Sea Gastrodon',4,111,83,68,39,92,82,'Its body is covered in a sticky slime. It''s very susceptible to dehydration, so it can''t spend too much time on land.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (424,0,'Ambipom',4,75,100,66,115,60,66,'To eat, it deftly shucks nuts with its two tails. It rarely uses its arms now.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (425,0,'Drifloon',4,90,50,34,70,60,44,'A Pokemon formed by the spirits of people and Pokemon. It loves damp, humid seasons.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (426,0,'Drifblim',4,150,80,44,80,90,54,'It''s drowzy in daytime, but flies off in the evening in big groups. No one knows where they go.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (427,0,'Buneary',4,55,66,44,85,44,56,'It slams foes by sharply uncoiling its rolled ears. It stings enough to make a grown-up cry in pain.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (428,0,'Lopunny',4,65,76,84,105,54,96,'An extremely cautious Pokemon. It cloaks its body with its fluffy ear fur when it senses danger.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (428,1,'Mega Lopunny',6,65,136,94,135,54,96,'It swings its ears like whips and strikes its enemies with them. It has an intensely combative disposition.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (429,0,'Mismagius',4,60,60,60,105,105,105,'Its cries sound like incantations. Those hearing it are tormented by headaches and hallucinations.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (430,0,'Honchkrow',4,100,125,52,71,105,52,'Becoming active at night, it is known to swarm with numerous Murkrow in tow.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (431,0,'Glameow',4,49,55,42,85,42,37,'It claws if displeased and purrs when affectionate. Its fickleness is very popular among some.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (432,0,'Purugly',4,71,82,64,112,64,59,'It is a brazen brute that barges its way into another Pokemon''s nest and claims it as its own.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (433,0,'Chingling',4,45,30,50,45,65,50,'It emits cries by agitating an orb at the back of its throat. It moves with flouncing hops.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (434,0,'Stunky',4,63,63,47,74,41,41,'It protects itself by spraying a noxious fluid from its rear. The stench lingers for 24 hours.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (435,0,'Skuntank',4,103,93,67,84,71,61,'It sprays a vile-smelling fluid from the tip of its tail to attack. Its range is over 160 feet.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (436,0,'Bronzor',4,57,24,86,23,24,86,'Implements shaped like it were discovered in ancient tombs. It is unknown if they are related.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (437,0,'Bronzong',4,67,89,116,33,79,116,'One caused a news sensation when it was dug up at a construction site after a 2,000-year sleep.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (438,0,'Bonsly',4,50,80,95,10,10,45,'It looks as if it is always crying. It is actually adjusting its body''s fluid levels by eliminating excess.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (439,0,'Mime Jr.',4,20,25,45,60,70,90,'It habitually mimics foes. Once mimicked, the foe cannot take its eyes off this Pokemon.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (440,0,'Happiny',4,100,5,5,30,15,65,'It loves round white things. It carries an egg-shaped rock in imitation of Chansey.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (441,0,'Chatot',4,76,65,45,91,92,42,'It can learn and speak human words. If they gather, they all learn the same saying.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (442,0,'Spiritomb',4,50,92,108,35,92,108,'A Pokemon that was formed by 108 spirits. It is bound to a fissure in an odd keystone.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (443,0,'Gible',4,58,70,45,42,40,45,'It nests in small, horizontal holes in cave walls. It pounces to catch prey that stray too close.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (444,0,'Gabite',4,68,90,65,82,50,55,'There is a long-held belief that medicine made from its scales will heal even incurable illnesses.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (445,0,'Garchomp',4,108,130,95,102,80,85,'When it folds up its body and extends its wings, it looks like a jet plane. It flies at sonic speed.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (445,1,'Mega Garchomp',6,108,170,115,92,120,95,'Its vaunted wings become scythes, sending it mad with rage. It swings its scythes wildly and slices the ground to pieces.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (446,0,'Munchlax',4,135,85,40,5,40,85,'It wolfs down its weight in food once a day, swallowing food whole with almost no chewing.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (447,0,'Riolu',4,40,70,40,60,35,40,'The aura that emanates from its body intensifies to alert others if it is afraid or sad.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (448,0,'Lucario',4,70,110,70,90,115,70,'It has the ability to sense the auras of all things. It understands human speech.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (448,1,'Mega Lucario',6,70,145,88,112,140,70,'It readies itself to face its enemies by focusing its mental energies. Its fighting style can be summed up in a single word: heartless.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (449,0,'Hippopotas',4,68,72,78,32,38,42,'It lives in arid places. Instead of perspiration, it expels grainy sand from its body.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (450,0,'Hippowdon',4,108,112,118,47,68,72,'It blasts internally stored sand from ports on its body to create a towering twister for attack.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (451,0,'Skorupi',4,40,50,90,65,30,55,'It grips prey with its tail claws and injects poison. It tenaciously hangs on until the poison takes.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (452,0,'Drapion',4,70,90,110,95,60,75,'It has the power in its clawed arms to make scrap of a car. The tips of its claws release poison.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (453,0,'Croagunk',4,48,61,40,50,61,40,'Its cheeks hold poison sacs. It tries to catch foes off guard to jab them with toxic fingers.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (454,0,'Toxicroak',4,83,106,65,85,86,65,'Its knuckle claws secrete a toxin so vile that even a scratch could prove fatal.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (455,0,'Carnivine',4,74,100,72,46,90,72,'It attracts prey with its sweet-smelling saliva, then chomps down. It takes a whole day to eat prey.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (456,0,'Finneon',4,49,49,56,66,49,61,'After long exposure to sunlight, the patterns on its tail fins shine vividly when darkness arrives.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (457,0,'Lumineon',4,69,69,76,91,69,86,'It lives on the deep-sea floor. It attracts prey by flashing the patterns on its four tail fins.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (458,0,'Mantyke',4,45,20,50,50,60,120,'A friendly Pokemon that captures the subtle flows of seawater using its two antennae.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (459,0,'Snover',4,60,62,50,40,62,60,'It lives on snowy mountains. Having had little contact with humans, it is boldly inquisitive.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (460,0,'Abomasnow',4,90,92,75,60,92,85,'It whips up blizzards in mountains that are always buried in snow. It is the abominable snowman.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (460,1,'Mega Abomasnow',6,90,132,105,30,132,105,'It whips up blizzards in mountains that are always buried in snow. It is the abominable snowman.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (461,0,'Weavile',4,70,120,65,125,45,85,'They live in cold regions, forming groups of four or five that hunt prey with impressive coordination.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (462,0,'Magnezone',4,70,70,115,60,130,90,'It evolved from exposure to a special magnetic field. Three units generate magnetism.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (463,0,'Lickilicky',4,110,85,95,50,80,95,'It wraps things with its extensible tongue. Getting too close to it will leave you soaked with drool.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (464,0,'Rhyperior',4,115,140,130,40,55,55,'It puts rocks in holes in its palms and uses its muscles to shoot them. Geodude are shot at rare times.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (465,0,'Tangrowth',4,100,100,125,50,110,50,'It ensnares prey by extending arms made of vines. Losing arms to predators does not trouble it.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (466,0,'Electivire',4,75,123,67,95,95,85,'It pushes the tips of its two tails against the foe, then lets loose with over 20,000 volts of power.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (467,0,'Magmortar',4,75,95,67,83,125,95,'It blasts fireballs of over 3,600 degrees F from the ends of its arms. It lives in volcanic craters.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (468,0,'Togekiss',4,85,50,95,80,120,115,'It will never appear where there is strife. Its sightings have become rare recently.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (469,0,'Yanmega',4,86,76,86,95,116,56,'By churning its wings, it creates shock waves that inflict critical internal injuries to foes.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (470,0,'Leafeon',4,65,110,130,95,60,65,'Just like a plant, it uses photosynthesis. As a result, it is always enveloped in clear air.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (471,0,'Glaceon',4,65,60,110,65,130,95,'As a protective technique, it can completely freeze its fur to make its hairs stand like needles.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (472,0,'Gliscor',4,75,95,125,95,45,75,'It observes prey while hanging inverted from branches. When the chance presents itself, it swoops!');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (473,0,'Mamoswine',4,110,130,80,80,70,60,'Its impressive tusks are made of ice. The population thinned when it turned warm after the ice age.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (474,0,'Porygon-Z',4,85,80,70,90,135,75,'Additional software was installed to make it a better Pokemon. It began acting oddly, however.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (475,0,'Gallade',4,68,125,65,80,65,115,'A master of courtesy and swordsmanship, it fights using extending swords on its elbows.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (475,1,'Mega Gallade',6,68,165,95,110,65,115,'A master of courtesy and swordsmanship, it fights using extending swords on its elbows.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (476,0,'Probopass',4,60,55,145,40,75,150,'It exudes strong magnetism from all over. It controls three small units called Mini-Noses.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (477,0,'Dusknoir',4,45,100,135,45,65,135,'The antenna on its head captures radio waves from the world of spirits that command it to take people there.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (478,0,'Froslass',4,70,80,70,110,80,70,'It freezes foes with an icy breath nearly -60 degrees F. What seems to be its body is actually hollow.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (479,0,'Rotom',4,50,50,77,91,95,77,'Its body is composed of plasma. It is known to infiltrate electronic devices and wreak havoc.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (479,1,'Heat Rotom Rotom',4,50,65,107,86,105,107,'This Rotom has possessed a convection microwave oven that uses a special motor. It also has a flair for manipulating flames.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (479,2,'Wash Rotom Rotom',4,50,65,107,86,105,107,'This form of Rotom enjoys coming up with water-based pranks. Be careful with it if you don''t want your room flooded.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (479,3,'Frost Rotom Rotom',4,50,65,107,86,105,107,'Rotom assumes this form when it takes over a refrigerator powered by a special motor. It battles by spewing cold air.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (479,4,'Fan Rotom Rotom',4,50,65,107,86,105,107,'In this form, Rotom applies its new power over wind to its love of pranks. It will happily blow away any important documents it can find.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (479,5,'Mow Rotom Rotom',4,50,65,107,86,105,107,'This is Rotom after it''s seized control of a lawn mower that has a special motor. As it mows down grass, it scatters the clippings everywhere.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (480,0,'Uxie',4,75,75,130,95,75,130,'Known as The Being of Knowledge. It is said that it can wipe out the memory of those who see its eyes.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (481,0,'Mesprit',4,80,105,105,80,105,105,'Known as The Being of Emotion. It taught humans the nobility of sorrow, pain, and joy.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (482,0,'Azelf',4,75,125,70,115,125,70,'Known as The Being of Willpower. It sleeps at the bottom of a lake to keep the world in balance.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (483,0,'Dialga',4,100,120,120,90,150,100,'It has the power to control time. It appears in Sinnoh-region myths as an ancient deity.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (484,0,'Palkia',4,90,120,100,100,150,120,'It has the ability to distort space. It is described as a deity in Sinnoh-region mythology.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (485,0,'Heatran',4,91,90,106,77,130,106,'It dwells in volcanic caves. It digs in with its cross-shaped feet to crawl on ceilings and walls.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (486,0,'Regigigas',4,110,160,110,100,80,110,'There is an enduring legend that states this Pokemon towed continents with ropes.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (487,0,'Altered Forme Giratina',4,150,100,120,90,100,120,'A Pokemon that is said to live in a world on the reverse side of ours. It appears in an ancient cemetery.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (487,1,'Origin Forme Giratina',4,150,120,100,90,120,100,'A Pokemon that is said to live in a world on the reverse side of ours. It appears in an ancient cemetery.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (488,0,'Cresselia',4,120,70,120,85,75,130,'Shiny particles are released from its wings like a veil. It is said to represent the crescent moon.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (489,0,'Phione',4,80,80,80,80,80,80,'A Pokemon that lives in warm seas. It inflates the flotation sac on its head to drift and search for food.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (490,0,'Manaphy',4,100,100,100,100,100,100,'Born on a cold seafloor, it will swim great distances to return to its birthplace.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (491,0,'Darkrai',4,70,90,90,125,135,90,'It can lull people to sleep and make them dream. It is active during nights of the new moon.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (492,0,'Land Forme Shaymin',4,100,100,100,100,100,100,'It lives in flower patches and avoids detection by curling up to look like a flowering plant.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (492,1,'Sky Forme Shaymin',4,100,103,75,127,120,75,'It lives in flower patches and avoids detection by curling up to look like a flowering plant.');
INSERT INTO Pokemon VALUES (493,0,'Normal Type Arceus',4,120,120,120,120,120,120,'It is described in mythology as the Pokemon that shaped the universe with its 1,000 arms.');
